#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIRBOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIRBOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "The boat's still quite sound. No patching it up just yet."
msgstr "船還很精神呢，先不用給它包紮啦。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIRBOAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIRBOAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "The hull is sound as it is."
msgstr "船身現在還很結實。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIRBOAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIRBOAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll save the patch for an actual leak."
msgstr "等真的漏水了再用補丁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.EMBARK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.EMBARK.INUSE"
msgid "Oh! There's someone aboard already. I'll wait."
msgstr "哇！那艘船已經有人啦，等一下下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.EMBARK.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.EMBARK.INUSE.1"
msgid "After you. I've time to wait."
msgstr "您先，我等一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.EMBARK.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.EMBARK.INUSE.2"
msgid "Let me know when you're finished."
msgstr "用完了請叫我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.INSPECTBOAT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.INSPECTBOAT.INUSE"
msgid "Someone's inspecting it. I'll be good and wait my turn."
msgstr "前面有人檢查中，露易絲會乖乖排隊的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.INSPECTBOAT.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.INSPECTBOAT.INUSE.1"
msgid "After you. I've time to wait."
msgstr "您先，我等一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.INSPECTBOAT.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.INSPECTBOAT.INUSE.2"
msgid "Let me know when you're finished."
msgstr "用完了請叫我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.FLOODED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.FLOODED"
msgid "Even a practiced hand would slip in all this water..."
msgstr "水漫成這樣，手藝再好也會打滑呀……"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.FLOODED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.FLOODED.1"
msgid "I can't lay my tools down in this water."
msgstr "地上積著水，沒辦法放工具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.FLOODED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.FLOODED.2"
msgid "I'll find some dry ground to work on."
msgstr "我去找塊乾地開工。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MAGIC_FAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MAGIC_FAIL"
msgid "Huh? That spell's as contrary as a little tsukumogami."
msgstr "咦？術式沒聽話，像付喪神鬧彆扭一樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAGIC_FAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAGIC_FAIL.1"
msgid "I'm still standing in the same place."
msgstr "我還站在原地。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAGIC_FAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAGIC_FAIL.2"
msgid "Strange. I felt nothing happen."
msgstr "奇怪，什麼動靜都沒有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SHARX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SHARX"
msgid "Something's churning up the sea. I'll keep my distance before I draw."
msgstr "海裡有東西在鬧騰，拔刀前先保持距離。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHARX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHARX.1"
msgid "A fin off the stern!"
msgstr "船尾有背鰭！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHARX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHARX.2"
msgid "Keep your hands inside the boat."
msgstr "手別伸到船外。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE"
msgid "An X! That's the treasure giving me a wink. Ha!"
msgstr "X 就是寶物的眨眼暗號，haha！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE.1"
msgid "There's a cross on the map."
msgstr "圖上畫了個叉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE.2"
msgid "I'll bring the shovel along."
msgstr "我把鏟子帶上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE_DISCOVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE_DISCOVER"
msgid "Found it! The treasure's gleaming right here."
msgstr "找到了！寶藏在這裡閃閃發光耶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE_DISCOVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE_DISCOVER.1"
msgid "There's something buried just here."
msgstr "這裡埋著東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE_DISCOVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TREASURE_DISCOVER.2"
msgid "I heard the shovel strike something!"
msgstr "我聽見鏟子碰到東西了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MORETREASURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MORETREASURE"
msgid "This is my lucky day. I'd have drawn the very best fortune!"
msgstr "今天運氣像抽到大吉籤一樣，超棒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MORETREASURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MORETREASURE.1"
msgid "There's something buried just here."
msgstr "這裡埋著東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MORETREASURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MORETREASURE.2"
msgid "I heard the shovel strike something!"
msgstr "我聽見鏟子碰到東西了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_TREASURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_TREASURE"
msgid "These islands aren't on the chart. Have I wandered into a hidden village?"
msgstr "這張圖不是這裡的海域，像誤入隠れ裡了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_TREASURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_TREASURE.1"
msgid "None of these islands match my map."
msgstr "圖上沒有這幾座島。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_TREASURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_TREASURE.2"
msgid "I'll save this chart for another sea."
msgstr "這張圖留著去另一片海時用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_PLANT"
msgid "It doesn't like this soil. It seems cruel to plant it here."
msgstr "它不適合這片土，硬種下去會可憐的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_PLANT.1"
msgid "I can't get it to take root here."
msgstr "它在這裡扎不了根。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTHER_WORLD_PLANT.2"
msgid "We should take it back to its own soil."
msgstr "得把它帶回它生長的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE.1"
msgid "Seawater has blurred the letters. I can't read any of them."
msgstr "字被海水親到糊掉了，讀不出來呢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE.1.1"
msgid "The salt washed out every word."
msgstr "字跡全讓海水泡掉了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE.1.2"
msgid "All that survived was the paper."
msgstr "只有紙還在，字已經沒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_VOLCANO_ERUPT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_VOLCANO_ERUPT"
msgid "The volcano speaks! We've angered a god!"
msgstr "火山開口啦，「神明」發怒了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VOLCANO_ERUPT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VOLCANO_ERUPT.1"
msgid "Look up! Stones are falling!"
msgstr "抬頭，石頭落下來了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VOLCANO_ERUPT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VOLCANO_ERUPT.2"
msgid "Find open ground!"
msgstr "往開闊處走！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_WARN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_WARN"
msgid "The fog's so thick I've lost sight of the tip of my sword."
msgstr "霧好厚，劍尖都像被藏起來了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_WARN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_WARN.1"
msgid "I can hardly see past the bow."
msgstr "越過船頭就看不清了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_WARN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_WARN.2"
msgid "Keep close in this fog."
msgstr "這麼大的霧，跟緊些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_LOSECONTROL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_LOSECONTROL"
msgid "Oh dear. Has a tanuki run off with my sense of direction?"
msgstr "糟糕，方向感被狸貓偷走了嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_LOSECONTROL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_LOSECONTROL.1"
msgid "I can hardly see past the bow."
msgstr "越過船頭就看不清了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_LOSECONTROL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_LOSECONTROL.2"
msgid "Keep close in this fog."
msgstr "這麼大的霧，跟緊些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_RETURN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_RETURN"
msgid "Out at last! My eyes were starting to spin."
msgstr "呼，終於出來了，眼睛差點變成蚊香圈。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_RETURN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_RETURN.1"
msgid "There's the horizon again!"
msgstr "又看得到海平線了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_RETURN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAPWRAP_RETURN.2"
msgid "Let me get my bearings after all that fog."
msgstr "霧散了，我得重新認一認方向。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CRAB_ESCAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_CRAB_ESCAPE"
msgid "Oh! A quick little sidestep and it got away."
msgstr "哎呀，橫著跑掉了，真會耍小聰明。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CRAB_ESCAPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CRAB_ESCAPE.1"
msgid "It went straight under the sand!"
msgstr "它直接鑽進沙裡了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CRAB_ESCAPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CRAB_ESCAPE.2"
msgid "Those little legs are faster than they look."
msgstr "它那幾條小腿跑得真快。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TRAWL_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_TRAWL_FULL"
msgid "The trawl's full! Time to bring in the catch."
msgstr "拖網滿啦，收穫時間到～"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAWL_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAWL_FULL.1"
msgid "The net's dragging. Give me a hand!"
msgstr "網沉了，來搭把手！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAWL_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAWL_FULL.2"
msgid "Time to see what we caught."
msgstr "該看看這網撈到了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_DAMAGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_DAMAGED"
msgid "My boat's hurt. A swordswoman ought to have a gentle hand for repairs too."
msgstr "船受傷了，劍士也要會溫柔修補。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_DAMAGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_DAMAGED.1"
msgid "Water under the boards! Pass me a patch."
msgstr "船板在滲水！把補丁遞給我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_DAMAGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_DAMAGED.2"
msgid "I can feel water round my ankles."
msgstr "水都漫到我腳踝了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING"
msgid "Oh dear. The sea seems to be inviting me for a swim..."
msgstr "不妙，海面在邀請她下去玩了……！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING.1"
msgid "Everyone to shore! Leave the cargo!"
msgstr "往岸上去！先別管貨物了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING.2"
msgid "The deck's going under!"
msgstr "甲板要沒進水裡了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING_IMMINENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING_IMMINENT"
msgid "The boat's going down! No time for a farewell poem!"
msgstr "哇啊，船要沉了！先別寫辭世句啦！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING_IMMINENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING_IMMINENT.1"
msgid "Everyone to shore! Leave the cargo!"
msgstr "往岸上去！先別管貨物了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING_IMMINENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING_IMMINENT.2"
msgid "The deck's going under!"
msgstr "甲板要沒進水裡了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WAVE_BOOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WAVE_BOOST"
msgid "Off with the wave! Here we go!"
msgstr "乘浪一閃，出發～！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WAVE_BOOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WAVE_BOOST.1"
msgid "That wave gave us quite a lift!"
msgstr "那道浪把船托起來了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WAVE_BOOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WAVE_BOOST.2"
msgid "Hold on, we're picking up speed!"
msgstr "抓穩，船快起來了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY"
msgid "Something huge is close. It feels like an umibozu on its nightly rounds."
msgstr "附近有大傢伙的氣息，像海坊主巡夜呢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY.1"
msgid "Fresh signs. It can't be far."
msgstr "痕跡很新，它就在附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY.2"
msgid "Quiet now. We're close."
msgstr "輕些，我們離它很近了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL"
msgid "No more bubbles. I've lost the trail."
msgstr "氣泡斷掉了，追蹤失敗，嗚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL.1"
msgid "Nothing past this point."
msgstr "到了這裡就找不到痕跡了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL.2"
msgid "I can't tell where it went from here."
msgstr "看不出它接下來去了哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING"
msgid "These spring waves could fool even a swordswoman's eyes."
msgstr "春浪太亂，連劍士的眼睛也會被騙過去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING.1"
msgid "Nothing past this point."
msgstr "到了這裡就找不到痕跡了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WHALE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING.2"
msgid "I can't tell where it went from here."
msgstr "看不出它接下來去了哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOTSAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOTSAM"
msgid "It's floating just out there. If only my scabbard had a hook."
msgstr "漂在那裡耶，要是劍鞘能變成鉤子就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTSAM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTSAM.1"
msgid "Something from a ship, judging by the splinters."
msgstr "看這木茬，像是從船上掉下來的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTSAM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTSAM.2"
msgid "I wonder which shore it started from."
msgstr "不知它是從哪片岸邊漂來的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED"
msgid "Nobody left aboard... I wonder if this is how Urashima Taro's story went on."
msgstr "船主不見了……有點像浦島太郎的後續呢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED.1"
msgid "Nobody seems to be tending it now."
msgstr "看來暫時沒人照看了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED.2"
msgid "I wonder when someone last came this way."
msgstr "不知道上次有人來是什麼時候。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "That sodden boat looks as if it's waiting for someone to talk to."
msgstr "那艘船濕漉漉地等人說話。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the sunken boat."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴頓女士對沉船了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先單獨收好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_BURNT"
msgid "Sunk and scorched. Oh, what a sorry sight."
msgstr "又沉又焦，太慘啦。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_BURNT.1"
msgid "Water all around and it still burned."
msgstr "周圍都是水，居然還是燒壞了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_BURNT.2"
msgid "The water hasn't washed away the scorch marks."
msgstr "燒焦的痕跡還沒被水沖掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LOGRAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LOGRAFT"
msgid "Logs laid out in a row! I suppose that counts as a boat."
msgstr "木頭排排站，勉強算船，haha。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LOGRAFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LOGRAFT.1"
msgid "I'll keep my things tied down between the logs."
msgstr "我得把東西綁在木排上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LOGRAFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LOGRAFT.2"
msgid "I can see the water between my toes."
msgstr "低頭就能從腳趾間看見海水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_RAFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_RAFT"
msgid "Plain and dependable, just like my practice sword."
msgstr "樸素但是可靠，像練習用竹刀一樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_RAFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_RAFT.1"
msgid "I'll keep my things tied down between the logs."
msgstr "我得把東西綁在木排上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_RAFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_RAFT.2"
msgid "I can see the water between my toes."
msgstr "低頭就能從腳趾間看見海水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROW"
msgid "An arm workout? Very well. I won't give up."
msgstr "要用手臂修行嗎？好吧，露易絲不會輸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROW.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the row boat while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平靜，我看看划艇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROW.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "總比到了風浪裡再處理容易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CARGO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CARGO"
msgid "Room for my lunch, my supplies, and a little courage in reserve."
msgstr "能裝好多東西，便當、材料、還有備用的勇氣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CARGO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CARGO.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the cargo boat."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪時貨船表現如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CARGO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CARGO.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙這邊的時候，誰來留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ARMOURED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ARMOURED"
msgid "Stout as a breastplate. I feel safer already!"
msgstr "厚實得像穿了胴甲，安心感上升！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ARMOURED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ARMOURED.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the armored boat."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪時裝甲船表現如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ARMOURED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ARMOURED.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "總比到了風浪裡再處理容易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ENCRUSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ENCRUSTED"
msgid "The shells stick so close together. A little ward against the sea."
msgstr "貝殼黏得好認真，像小小的海邊結界。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ENCRUSTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ENCRUSTED.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the encrusted boat."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪時覆殼船表現如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ENCRUSTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ENCRUSTED.2"
msgid "I won't go far from the dock until it's ready."
msgstr "準備妥當前，我不會離碼頭太遠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAPTAINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAPTAINHAT"
msgid "Put this on, and even the sea breeze calls me Captain."
msgstr "戴上它，海風都喊她船長大人啦。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAPTAINHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAPTAINHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the captain hat."
msgstr "不知道船長帽會不會壓住劉海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAPTAINHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAPTAINHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出門前我想先照一下鏡子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_TORCH"
msgid "A little flame for a night at sea. Easy there, boat."
msgstr "夜航的小火苗，別把船嚇到喔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_TORCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_TORCH.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the boat torch."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪時船載火炬表現如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_TORCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_TORCH.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "總比到了風浪裡再處理容易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LANTERN"
msgid "A cool light's lovely too. A little foxfire to see by."
msgstr "冷冷的光也不錯，像狐火借來照路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LANTERN.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the boat lantern while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平靜，我看看船載燈籠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LANTERN.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the empty bottle to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了空瓶子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOATREPAIRKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOATREPAIRKIT"
msgid "Just the thing to patch the little cracks with a gentle hand."
msgstr "小裂縫交給它，溫柔補好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATREPAIRKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATREPAIRKIT.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the boat repair kit in my pack."
msgstr "得在包裡給修船套件騰個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATREPAIRKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATREPAIRKIT.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the rope to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了繩子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOATCANNON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOATCANNON"
msgid "A long-distance sword draw? Oh! It's a cannon."
msgstr "哇，遠距離居合？不對，是大炮啦。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATCANNON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATCANNON.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the boat cannon in my pack."
msgstr "得在包裡給船炮騰個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATCANNON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATCANNON.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the log to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了木頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOTTLELANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOTTLELANTERN"
msgid "The light is so cold and alien."
msgstr "這光冰冷而疏遠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOTTLELANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOTTLELANTERN.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the bottle lantern to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把水瓶提燈帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOTTLELANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOTTLELANTERN.2"
msgid "I can see where the bioluminescence went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了熒光生物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIOLUMINESCENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIOLUMINESCENCE"
msgid "It's a cold light. Not like a flame at all."
msgstr "這是冷的光。一點也不像火焰。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIOLUMINESCENCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIOLUMINESCENCE.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the bioluminescence in my pack."
msgstr "得在包裡給熒光生物騰個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIOLUMINESCENCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIOLUMINESCENCE.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the bottle lantern."
msgstr "要做水瓶提燈，就得用到這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLPHIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLPHIN"
msgid "You don't look particularly flammable."
msgstr "你看上去不是特別易燃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLPHIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLPHIN.1"
msgid "Where would I find the bottlenose ballphin after dark?"
msgstr "不知道瓶鼻海豚天黑以後會去哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLPHIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLPHIN.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想擋住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLPHINHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALLPHINHOUSE"
msgid "It's the castle of the bouncy things... A bouncy castle."
msgstr "這是有充滿活力的傢伙們的城堡...一座彈性城堡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLPHINHOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLPHINHOUSE.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at the ballphin palace today."
msgstr "不知道今天海豚宮殿裡有沒有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLPHINHOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLPHINHOUSE.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口讓出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DORSALFIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DORSALFIN"
msgid "It's, like... a fin, I guess?"
msgstr "它像是...魚鰭，對嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DORSALFIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DORSALFIN.1"
msgid "Could we take the dorsal fin on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能帶著背鰭吃嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DORSALFIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DORSALFIN.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the castaway with some of this."
msgstr "說起來，做唱片-漂流者就能用上這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN"
msgid "Aw, but I like mine with Ballphin!"
msgstr "噢，但我喜歡有海豚肉的！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the \"ballphin free\" tuna to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把鮪魚罐頭帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUNACAN.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留給需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH"
msgid "It's shriveling up."
msgstr "它縮成一團。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH.1"
msgid "I can see the jellyfish through the water."
msgstr "隔著水也看得見水母。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH.2"
msgid "I'll stay still until the surface clears."
msgstr "我站穩不動，等水面清下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_DEAD"
msgid "Won't be stingin' anyone now."
msgstr "現在再也不能蜇人了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_DEAD.1"
msgid "I can see the dead jellyfish through the water."
msgstr "隔著水也看得見死水母。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_DEAD.2"
msgid "I'll stay still until the surface clears."
msgstr "我站穩不動，等水面清下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_COOKED"
msgid "It actually looks edible."
msgstr "它確實看起來可以吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the cooked jellyfish cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "熟水母要放涼些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分開，一人嘗一口？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED"
msgid "I'll call you \"Jerald\"."
msgstr "我要叫你「傑拉德」。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED.1"
msgid "I'll leave a marker by these leaves."
msgstr "我想在葉叢邊留個記號。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYFISH_PLANTED.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling at the roots."
msgstr "我湊近看就好，不去拔根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYJERKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYJERKY"
msgid "Looks chewy."
msgstr "看起來很耐嚼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYJERKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYJERKY.1"
msgid "I can take the dried jellyfish along without a bowl."
msgstr "帶上晾乾的水母就不必拿碗了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYJERKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYJERKY.2"
msgid "I like provisions I can tuck into a sleeve."
msgstr "我喜歡能塞進袖兜裡的口糧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH"
msgid "Haha, it's squishy."
msgstr "哈哈，它濕軟又黏糊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH.1"
msgid "A little ripple gave the rainbow jellyfish away."
msgstr "一點水紋暴露了彩虹水母的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光線變化真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_DEAD"
msgid "It's still moving."
msgstr "它還在動呢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_DEAD.1"
msgid "I can see the dead rainbow jellyfish through the water."
msgstr "隔著水也看得見死彩虹水母。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_DEAD.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光線變化真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED"
msgid "I wonder if the colors add flavor."
msgstr "我想知道那些顏色會不會增加風味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked rainbow jellyfish."
msgstr "吃熟彩虹水母我想加一點鹽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "為一口熱食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_PLANTED"
msgid "Hey fancyfish, get over here!"
msgstr "嘿，漂亮魚兒，到這裡來！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_PLANTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_PLANTED.1"
msgid "I'd remember where that patch grows."
msgstr "我會記住這片植物長在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_PLANTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINBOWJELLYFISH_PLANTED.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling at the roots."
msgstr "我湊近看就好，不去拔根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP"
msgid "I want twenty!"
msgstr "我要二十個！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP.1"
msgid "I'd eat it before the sun melts the edges."
msgstr "得趕在太陽曬化邊緣前吃掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYOPOP.2"
msgid "A cold treat is just what I wanted."
msgstr "我正想來點冰涼的點心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CROCODOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CROCODOG"
msgid "You don't look that tough."
msgstr "你看起來沒那麼厲害。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROCODOG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROCODOG.1"
msgid "I'd give the crocodog room to turn."
msgstr "得給鱷狗留點轉身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROCODOG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROCODOG.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪裡休息腳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POISONCROCODOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POISONCROCODOG"
msgid "Back off!"
msgstr "走開！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONCROCODOG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONCROCODOG.1"
msgid "I can just make out the poison crocodog from here."
msgstr "我在這裡剛好看得見毒鱷狗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONCROCODOG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONCROCODOG.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪裡休息腳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERCROCODOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERCROCODOG"
msgid "I'm watching you!"
msgstr "我在盯著你！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERCROCODOG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERCROCODOG.1"
msgid "I'd give the water crocodog room to turn."
msgstr "得給水鱷狗留點轉身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERCROCODOG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERCROCODOG.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "這裡的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER"
msgid "You look kinda dumb."
msgstr "你看起來有點呆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER.1"
msgid "The colours on the purple grouper are even brighter in the water."
msgstr "紫石斑魚身上的顏色在水裡更鮮亮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER.2"
msgid "I could watch those fins turn in the light all afternoon."
msgstr "魚鰭在光下一轉一轉的，我能看一下午。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH"
msgid "Found you!"
msgstr "找到你了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH.1"
msgid "A little ripple gave the pierrot fish away."
msgstr "一點水紋暴露了小丑魚的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光線變化真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO"
msgid "Is living underwater as awful as it sounds?"
msgstr "住在水裡是不是就像聽起來那麼糟糕？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO.1"
msgid "The colours on the neon quattro are even brighter in the water."
msgstr "霓虹魚身上的顏色在水裡更鮮亮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO.2"
msgid "I could watch those fins turn in the light all afternoon."
msgstr "魚鰭在光下一轉一轉的，我能看一下午。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER_COOKED"
msgid "Fire burned the grossest bits right off."
msgstr "火燒出了最噁心的玩意。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked purple grouper."
msgstr "吃熟紫石斑魚我想加一點鹽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLE_GROUPER_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分開，一人嘗一口？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH_COOKED"
msgid "I burned it just right."
msgstr "我燒出來的，還不錯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the cooked pierrot fish before I saw it."
msgstr "還沒看見熟小丑魚，先聞到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIERROT_FISH_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "為一口熱食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO_COOKED"
msgid "The fire got rid of most of the fish smell."
msgstr "火去除了大部分的魚腥味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the cooked neon quattro."
msgstr "有人給我留了一份熟霓虹魚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEON_QUATTRO_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最後一點留給回程。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE"
msgid "Ughh, is there anything besides fish out here??"
msgstr "唉，這裡除了魚還有沒有別的東西？？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE.1"
msgid "I'd save a serving of the tropical bouillabaisse for the person who cooked."
msgstr "我想給做飯的人也留一份熱帶魚湯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPICALBOUILLABAISSE.2"
msgid "This is worth getting a clean plate for."
msgstr "值得專門拿個乾淨盤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.EMPTY"
msgid "I gotta put something in there to grow fish."
msgstr "我得放些東西進去養魚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the fish farm at the moment."
msgstr "養魚場裡面什麼也沒有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.STOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.STOCKED"
msgid "Still no fish yet."
msgstr "魚還沒出來。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.STOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.STOCKED.1"
msgid "The roe is in. Now we wait."
msgstr "魚卵放好了，接下來就等著。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.STOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.STOCKED.2"
msgid "I can check the water without disturbing the pen."
msgstr "我能看看水裡的動靜，不驚擾魚欄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.ONEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.ONEFISH"
msgid "Yesss! A fish!"
msgstr "好極了！一條魚！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.ONEFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.ONEFISH.1"
msgid "One little fish in the pen."
msgstr "魚欄裡有一條小魚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.ONEFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.ONEFISH.2"
msgid "I can check the water without disturbing the pen."
msgstr "我能看看水裡的動靜，不驚擾魚欄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.TWOFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.TWOFISH"
msgid "Three fish are better than one."
msgstr "三條魚比一條魚好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.TWOFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.TWOFISH.1"
msgid "Two fish! They keep darting past each other."
msgstr "兩條魚！它們在彼此身邊游來游去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.TWOFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.TWOFISH.2"
msgid "I can check the water without disturbing the pen."
msgstr "我能看看水裡的動靜，不驚擾魚欄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.REDFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.REDFISH"
msgid "I feel like there could be more, though."
msgstr "但我覺得可能還有更多。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.REDFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.REDFISH.1"
msgid "I can see more fish gathering under the surface."
msgstr "能看見水下聚了更多魚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.REDFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.REDFISH.2"
msgid "I can check the water without disturbing the pen."
msgstr "我能看看水裡的動靜，不驚擾魚欄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.BLUEFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.BLUEFISH"
msgid "I'm swimming in fish!"
msgstr "我在魚群裡游泳！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.BLUEFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.BLUEFISH.1"
msgid "The whole pen is busy with fins now."
msgstr "現在整個魚欄裡都是遊動的魚鰭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.BLUEFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.BLUEFISH.2"
msgid "I can check the water without disturbing the pen."
msgstr "我能看看水裡的動靜，不驚擾魚欄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROE"
msgid "Ughh! That's nasty!!"
msgstr "噢！真噁心！！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROE.1"
msgid "Could we take the roe on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能帶著魚卵吃嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROE.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有個盼頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROE_COOKED"
msgid "I cooked them, but they're still nasty."
msgstr "我把它們煮熟了，可它們還是很噁心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROE_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked roe."
msgstr "吃熟魚卵我想加一點鹽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROE_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分開，一人嘗一口？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVIAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVIAR"
msgid "Fish eggs in a jar. Great."
msgstr "裝在罐子裡的魚卵。好極了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVIAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVIAR.1"
msgid "I'd like to share the caviar after practice."
msgstr "練完以後，我想和大家分著吃魚子醬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVIAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVIAR.2"
msgid "I'll get the plates out."
msgstr "我去取盤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CORMORANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CORMORANT"
msgid "It's got its butt in my water."
msgstr "它闖進了我的水域。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORMORANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORMORANT.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the cormorant with its wings spread."
msgstr "我想畫下鸕鷀展翅的樣子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORMORANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORMORANT.2"
msgid "There's a feather caught in the breeze."
msgstr "有根羽毛被風吹起來了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL"
msgid "Does it fear fire? It should."
msgstr "它怕火嗎？它應該怕。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the seagull with its wings spread."
msgstr "我想畫下海鷗展翅的樣子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL.2"
msgid "There's a feather caught in the breeze."
msgstr "有根羽毛被風吹起來了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER"
msgid "\"Squawk\" yourself."
msgstr "「嘎」你個頭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER.1"
msgid "I can see the seagull through the water."
msgstr "隔著水也看得見海鷗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAGULL_WATER.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光線變化真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN"
msgid "I like your nose."
msgstr "我喜歡你的嘴巴。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN.1"
msgid "I recognized the toucan by the beak."
msgstr "我憑鳥喙就認出了犀鳥。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOUCAN.2"
msgid "I'd have to sit quite still to see it land again."
msgstr "得坐著不動，它才肯再落下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PARROT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PARROT"
msgid "What a fiery color of red you are."
msgstr "你的顏色像火一樣紅。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT.1"
msgid "I recognized the parrot by the beak."
msgstr "我憑鳥喙就認出了鸚鵡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT.2"
msgid "There's a feather caught in the breeze."
msgstr "有根羽毛被風吹起來了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PARROT_PIRATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PARROT_PIRATE"
msgid "You're a skreechy scallywag."
msgstr "你是一個喜歡尖叫的無賴。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_PIRATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_PIRATE.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the pirate parrot with its wings spread."
msgstr "我想畫下海盜鸚鵡展翅的樣子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_PIRATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_PIRATE.2"
msgid "There's a feather caught in the breeze."
msgstr "有根羽毛被風吹起來了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.ON"
msgid "It's a fixin' machine."
msgstr "它是一台修理機。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.ON.1"
msgid "I can see the change in the sea yard from here."
msgstr "站在這裡也看得出修船碼頭的變化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.ON.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，現在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.OFF"
msgid "Just a big hunka junk without fuel."
msgstr "沒燃料時不過是一大塊垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.OFF.1"
msgid "All quiet around the sea yard for the moment."
msgstr "修船碼頭這會兒很安靜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.OFF.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎樣才能讓它再動起來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.LOWFUEL"
msgid "Running low."
msgstr "快沒燃料了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.LOWFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.LOWFUEL.1"
msgid "I ought to top up the sea yard."
msgstr "得給修船碼頭補些燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.LOWFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_YARD.LOWFUEL.2"
msgid "I'll go fetch fuel before it runs out."
msgstr "我趁它沒耗盡，去取點燃料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.EMBERS"
msgid "That doesn't even count as a fire!"
msgstr "那根本不算火啊！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.EMBERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.EMBERS.1"
msgid "There's hardly a glow left in the buoyant chiminea."
msgstr "漂浮火爐只剩一點暗紅了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.EMBERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.EMBERS.2"
msgid "I can barely see my hands by this light."
msgstr "借這點光幾乎看不清手了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.GENERIC"
msgid "Burn the sea!!"
msgstr "把大海燒了！！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the buoyant chiminea in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的漂浮火爐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the tar to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了焦油。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.HIGH"
msgid "Yess!! Burn!!!"
msgstr "好極了！！燒吧！！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.HIGH.1"
msgid "I can feel the buoyant chiminea from several paces back."
msgstr "隔著好幾步都能感覺到漂浮火爐的熱氣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.HIGH.2"
msgid "That's quite enough fuel for now."
msgstr "現在添的燃料夠多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.LOW"
msgid "That's barely even a fire!"
msgstr "幾乎就沒有火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.LOW.1"
msgid "I ought to top up the buoyant chiminea."
msgstr "得給漂浮火爐補些燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.LOW.2"
msgid "I'll go fetch fuel before it runs out."
msgstr "我趁它沒耗盡，去取點燃料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.NORMAL"
msgid "It's burning alright."
msgstr "燒得不錯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.NORMAL.1"
msgid "I could sit beside the buoyant chiminea for a while."
msgstr "我可以在漂浮火爐旁邊坐一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Just right. No need to feed it yet."
msgstr "這樣正好，暫時不用添燃料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.OUT"
msgid "Quick!! Relight it!"
msgstr "快點！！重新點燃它！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.OUT.1"
msgid "There isn't a flicker left in the buoyant chiminea."
msgstr "漂浮火爐裡一點火光都沒了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_CHIMINEA.OUT.2"
msgid "We'll have to light it again."
msgstr "得重新點起來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA"
msgid "Do you like your house, fire? You're welcome."
msgstr "喜歡你的家嗎，親愛的火焰？不用謝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the chiminea again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我們有閒暇，我想再來看看防風火爐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHIMINEA.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the log to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了木頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.ON"
msgid "It's getting me fuel for burnin'! Heheheh."
msgstr "它給我弄出燃料來燒了！嘿嘿嘿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.ON.1"
msgid "There. the tar extractor is working."
msgstr "好了，焦油提取器開始運作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.ON.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，現在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.OFF"
msgid "I guess I should turn it back on."
msgstr "我猜我應該把它重新啟動。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.OFF.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the tar extractor."
msgstr "焦油提取器現在沒什麼動靜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.OFF.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它沒動，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.LOWFUEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.LOWFUEL"
msgid "That's gonna need more fuel."
msgstr "需要多些燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.LOWFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.LOWFUEL.1"
msgid "I ought to top up the tar extractor."
msgstr "得給焦油提取器補些燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.LOWFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_EXTRACTOR.LOWFUEL.2"
msgid "I'll go fetch fuel before it runs out."
msgstr "我趁它沒耗盡，去取點燃料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR"
msgid "I bet that burns real good!"
msgstr "我敢打賭它很好燒！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the tar."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴頓女士對焦油了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR.2"
msgid "I should save some for the tar suit."
msgstr "我該給焦油套裝留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR_TRAP"
msgid "Would be better as a fire trap."
msgstr "當作火陷阱會比較好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_TRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_TRAP.1"
msgid "I'd mark the spot where we leave the tar trap."
msgstr "放下焦油陷阱時要做個記號。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_TRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_TRAP.2"
msgid "I'll let the others know to tread carefully here."
msgstr "我去提醒大家經過這裡要當心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR_POOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TAR_POOL"
msgid "There's something flammable down there."
msgstr "下面有些可燃物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_POOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_POOL.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the tar slick by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清焦油浮膜，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_POOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAR_POOL.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我記一下最近的避風處在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TARLAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TARLAMP"
msgid "I knew that goopy stuff'd burn good!"
msgstr "我就知道那個粘乎乎的東西很好燒！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TARLAMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TARLAMP.1"
msgid "I'd like the tar lamp near the path after dusk."
msgstr "黃昏後，我想讓焦油燈靠小路近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TARLAMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TARLAMP.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the seashell if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些貝殼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TARSUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TARSUIT"
msgid "This might not be the safest thing to light fires in."
msgstr "穿著它點火大概不太安全吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TARSUIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TARSUIT.1"
msgid "I could wear the tar suit over my training clothes."
msgstr "練習服外面還能再穿一層焦油套裝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TARSUIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TARSUIT.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the tar to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了焦油。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.GENERIC"
msgid "Cursed pirate magic?"
msgstr "受詛咒的海盜魔法？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Would the piratihatitator leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴著靈子海盜帽還能不能戴眼鏡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the parrot to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了鸚鵡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.BURNT"
msgid "Now it's more my style."
msgstr "現在更像我的風格了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the piratihatitator stood."
msgstr "靈子海盜帽原先的位置燒得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATIHATITATOR.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁邊的東西有沒有保住。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATEHAT"
msgid "I feel so piratey."
msgstr "好有海盜的感覺。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEHAT.1"
msgid "Would the pirate hat leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴著海盜帽還能不能戴眼鏡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEHAT.2"
msgid "I should save some for the piratihatitator."
msgstr "我該給靈子海盜帽留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.GENERIC"
msgid "Just out of reach."
msgstr "我夠不著。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the mussels in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的貽貝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把筆記本帶來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.STICKPLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.STICKPLANTED"
msgid "You will be mine soon."
msgstr "很快你們就是我的了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.STICKPLANTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.STICKPLANTED.1"
msgid "The stick's anchored where the mussels can settle."
msgstr "木棍已經固定好了，貽貝可以附上去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.STICKPLANTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_FARM.STICKPLANTED.2"
msgid "I'll come back to see what gathers on the wood."
msgstr "過些時候再來看看木頭上附了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL"
msgid "Open up, fella."
msgstr "打開你的殼，小子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL.1"
msgid "I'd like to share the mussel after practice."
msgstr "練完以後，我想和大家分著吃貽貝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the mussel bed."
msgstr "要做貽貝巖，就得用到這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_COOKED"
msgid "The fire opens their shells."
msgstr "火打開了它們的殼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the cooked mussel cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "熟貽貝要放涼些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最後一點留給回程。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSELBOUILLABAISE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSELBOUILLABAISE"
msgid "Mmm, smells good!"
msgstr "嗯，聞起來很好！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSELBOUILLABAISE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSELBOUILLABAISE.1"
msgid "I'd bring the mussel bouillabaise straight to the table."
msgstr "我把貽貝濃湯直接端上桌吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSELBOUILLABAISE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSELBOUILLABAISE.2"
msgid "I'd like to taste it before it gets cold."
msgstr "我想趁還熱著嘗一口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_BED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_BED"
msgid "Guess I should chuck'em in the ocean."
msgstr "我想我應該把它們丟到海裡去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_BED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_BED.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the mussel bed."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴頓女士對貽貝巖了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_BED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_BED.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the mussel if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些貽貝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_STICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_STICK"
msgid "The mussels like this stick for some reason."
msgstr "出於某種原因，貽貝喜歡這根棒子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_STICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_STICK.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the mussel stick to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把貝棒帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_STICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSSEL_STICK.2"
msgid "I can see where the seaweed went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了海帶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER"
msgid "Come here, you!"
msgstr "你！過來！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER.1"
msgid "I can see the wobster through the water."
msgstr "隔著水也看得見龍蝦。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光線變化真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD"
msgid "Edible in a pinch."
msgstr "必要時可以吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD.1"
msgid "I'll take it to the stove while it's still fresh."
msgstr "我趁它還新鮮，趕快拿去爐邊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD.2"
msgid "We can make something with today's catch."
msgstr "今天的漁獲能做道菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD_COOKED"
msgid "Lobster for dinner! Pinch me!"
msgstr "晚餐吃龍蝦！我不是在做夢吧！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the delicious wobster."
msgstr "有人給我留了一份美味的龍蝦。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "為一口熱食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERHOLE"
msgid "The happy lobster home."
msgstr "龍蝦幸福的家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERHOLE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the wobster den on my map."
msgstr "我在圖上標一下龍蝦巢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERHOLE.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先別走到看不見來路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERBISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERBISQUE"
msgid "I'm gonna eat this entire thing!"
msgstr "我要把這個全吃光！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERBISQUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERBISQUE.1"
msgid "I'd like to share the wobster bisque after practice."
msgstr "練完以後，我想和大家分著吃龍蝦湯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERBISQUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERBISQUE.2"
msgid "I'll get the plates out."
msgstr "我去取盤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERDINNER"
msgid "Yummmmmmm!"
msgstr "太好吃了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERDINNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERDINNER.1"
msgid "I'll save the wobster dinner for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "龍蝦晚宴要留到能好好坐下吃飯的時候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERDINNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTERDINNER.2"
msgid "A smaller portion for me if we're sharing."
msgstr "如果大家分著吃，我少拿一點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEATRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEATRAP"
msgid "C'mon, swim inside! It's cozy in there!"
msgstr "快游到裡面去！那裡面可舒服了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEATRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEATRAP.1"
msgid "I want to know exactly where the sea trap is set."
msgstr "我得記準海上陷阱佈置在什麼地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEATRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEATRAP.2"
msgid "Nobody should stumble into this on the way home."
msgstr "別讓回營地的人不小心踩上來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNING"
msgid "That's how I get rid of the snakes!"
msgstr "那就是我擺脫蛇的方法！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on the viney bush!"
msgstr "藤蔓叢著火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "讓我過去滅火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNT"
msgid "Those are fun to burn!"
msgstr "它們燒起來真好玩！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the viney bush."
msgstr "藤蔓叢燒成這樣，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.CHOPPED"
msgid "That's how you untangle them."
msgstr "就該這樣解開它們。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Nothing of the viney bush above the stump now."
msgstr "藤蔓叢只剩樹樁露在外面了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留塊空地種棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I bet these crackle and pop when they burn."
msgstr "我敢打賭這些東西燒起來會噼啪作響。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I want to look at the viney bush in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔細看看藤蔓叢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方讓它長開。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VINE"
msgid "I could use this for something. Or I could just burn it."
msgstr "我可以用這個來做點什麼，或乾脆燒掉也可以。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the vine in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的藤蔓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VINE.2"
msgid "I should save some for the jungle turf."
msgstr "我該給叢林地皮留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE"
msgid "Would you like to go back into the ground?"
msgstr "你想回到土裡嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the viney bush root."
msgstr "我知道有塊地適合藤蔓根。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BUSH_VINE.2"
msgid "A little earth around the roots should help."
msgstr "給根邊培些土會好一點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.GENERIC"
msgid "That gross food is trying to eat that rock."
msgstr "那些令人噁心的食材正在嘗試吃掉那塊石頭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the limpet rock just looking at it."
msgstr "光看著帽貝巖，就能想見它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.GENERIC.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，顏色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.PICKED"
msgid "The rock won't be bothered by those suckers for a bit."
msgstr "這塊石頭暫時擺脫了那些玩意兒的煩擾。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the limpet rock time to grow back."
msgstr "得給帽貝巖些時間重新生長。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIMPET.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路過我再來看看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS"
msgid "A little lick of flame and you'll be tasty."
msgstr "稍微過一下火你就成了美味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the limpets."
msgstr "不知道沃利會給帽貝配什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚餐才香。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED"
msgid "Pretty good!"
msgstr "很不錯！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked limpets."
msgstr "吃熟帽貝我想加一點鹽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "這次得記得先吃飯再練習。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BISQUE"
msgid "I guess I could eat that."
msgstr "我猜這個能吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISQUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISQUE.1"
msgid "I'd like to share the bisque after practice."
msgstr "練完以後，我想和大家分著吃鮮貝濃湯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISQUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISQUE.2"
msgid "I'll get the plates out."
msgstr "我去取盤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MACHETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MACHETE"
msgid "Or I could just burn my way through."
msgstr "或者我可以燒出一條路來。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MACHETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MACHETE.1"
msgid "I'd like to feel the balance of the machete."
msgstr "我想掂一下砍刀的重心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MACHETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MACHETE.2"
msgid "I should save some for the obsidian machete."
msgstr "我該給黑曜石砍刀留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE"
msgid "I don't want to scuff it up."
msgstr "我不想它被劃傷。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE.1"
msgid "I'd like to feel the balance of the luxury machete."
msgstr "我想掂一下黃金砍刀的重心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENMACHETE.2"
msgid "I can see where the gold nugget went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了金塊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THATCHPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.THATCHPACK"
msgid "Thatch you very much."
msgstr "小草包，有勞你了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THATCHPACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THATCHPACK.1"
msgid "I ought to check what's already in the thatch pack."
msgstr "該檢查一下茅草袋裡已經裝了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THATCHPACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THATCHPACK.2"
msgid "I'd like one place where my glasses won't get crushed."
msgstr "我想留個不會壓到眼鏡的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATEPACK"
msgid "Carrying this will build chest muscles."
msgstr "背這個有助於鍛鍊胸肌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEPACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEPACK.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the booty bag."
msgstr "暫時用不到的可以收進藏寶袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEPACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEPACK.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道備用物資收在哪裡，總歸省心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEASACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEASACK"
msgid "I have to wear this soggy thing on my back?"
msgstr "我一定要背上這個濕漉漉的東西？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASACK.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the sea sack."
msgstr "暫時用不到的可以收進海上保鮮袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASACK.2"
msgid "I can see where the seaweed went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了海帶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.GENERIC"
msgid "Soggy sea grass."
msgstr "濕漉漉的海草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd remember where that patch grows."
msgstr "我會記住這片植物長在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I want to see how it grows in this soil."
msgstr "我想看看它在這片土裡怎麼長。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.PICKED"
msgid "It's not grown back yet."
msgstr "它還沒長回來。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the seaweed time to grow back."
msgstr "得給海帶些時間重新生長。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_PLANTED.PICKED.2"
msgid "Best to leave the roots undisturbed now."
msgstr "這時候還是別動根了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED"
msgid "Soggy sea grass."
msgstr "濕漉漉的海草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED.1"
msgid "I could smell the seaweed from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在營地另一頭就聞到了海帶的氣味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the encrusted bumper kit."
msgstr "要做硬殼保險槓套件，就得用到這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_COOKED"
msgid "Not bad once you add fire."
msgstr "在火上燒熟後味道還不錯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the roasted seaweed before I saw it."
msgstr "還沒看見熟海帶，先聞到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分開，一人嘗一口？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_DRIED"
msgid "Healthy jerky."
msgstr "健康的風乾食物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_DRIED.1"
msgid "I can take the dried seaweed along without a bowl."
msgstr "帶上幹海帶就不必拿碗了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_DRIED.2"
msgid "I like provisions I can tuck into a sleeve."
msgstr "我喜歡能塞進袖兜裡的口糧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_STALK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_STALK"
msgid "A bunch of soggy weeds."
msgstr "一堆潮濕的雜草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_STALK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_STALK.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the seaweed stalk."
msgstr "我知道有塊地適合海帶莖。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_STALK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAWEED_STALK.2"
msgid "A little earth around the roots should help."
msgstr "給根邊培些土會好一點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DUBLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DUBLOON"
msgid "Pirate monies!"
msgstr "海盜的錢！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUBLOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUBLOON.1"
msgid "Even after the crossing I can read the stamp."
msgstr "過了這麼久的海，這枚錢幣上的印記還清楚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUBLOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUBLOON.2"
msgid "I'll count these on land. Too easy to drop one here."
msgstr "回岸上再數吧，在這裡很容易掉一枚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLOTMACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SLOTMACHINE"
msgid "This seems like a waste of time."
msgstr "這好像是在浪費時間。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLOTMACHINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLOTMACHINE.1"
msgid "I'd watch the slot machine at work before adjusting anything."
msgstr "調整以前，我想先看看老虎機怎麼運作。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLOTMACHINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLOTMACHINE.2"
msgid "I'd ask before I took the cover off."
msgstr "拆開外殼之前我會先問一聲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH"
msgid "Doesn't seem very smart."
msgstr "看起來不太聰明。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH.1"
msgid "A little ripple gave the dogfish away."
msgstr "一點水紋暴露了狗魚的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光線變化真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH_DEAD"
msgid "Time to chuck it in the fire!"
msgstr "是時候把它丟進火裡了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH_DEAD.1"
msgid "I'll take it to the stove while it's still fresh."
msgstr "我趁它還新鮮，趕快拿去爐邊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOLOFISH_DEAD.2"
msgid "We can make something with today's catch."
msgstr "今天的漁獲能做道菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH"
msgid "En garde!"
msgstr "準備戰鬥！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH.1"
msgid "The swordfish takes a different grip from my katana."
msgstr "劍魚的握法和我的刀不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH.2"
msgid "A light touch tells me more than a hard swing."
msgstr "輕輕試一下，比用力揮更能感覺出分量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH_DEAD"
msgid "Ugh, fire would get rid of that smell."
msgstr "呃，火可以除掉那股味道。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH_DEAD.1"
msgid "I'd check the grip on the dead swordfish before taking it out."
msgstr "帶死劍魚出門前，我想先檢查握柄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORDFISH_DEAD.2"
msgid "A light touch tells me more than a hard swing."
msgstr "輕輕試一下，比用力揮更能感覺出分量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CUTLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CUTLASS"
msgid "This sword smells."
msgstr "這把劍有臭味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLASS.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the cutlass supreme this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是誰想到把劍魚短劍做成這種形狀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLASS.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the dead swordfish to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了死劍魚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_1"
msgid "I can't say that word!"
msgstr "這個詞我念不出來！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_1.1"
msgid "What would the Pig King make of it?"
msgstr "不知道豬王看見它會怎麼想。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_1.2"
msgid "I can always spare one little corner of my pack."
msgstr "背包角落裡總還有點空。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
msgid "I've put away childish things."
msgstr "我已經把小時候的玩意兒都收起來了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2.1"
msgid "Of all the things to turn up here, it!"
msgstr "居然會在這裡找到它！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2.2"
msgid "I'll wipe it clean before I show anyone."
msgstr "拿給大家看以前，我先擦乾淨。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3"
msgid "It wants to meet my lighter."
msgstr "它倒像是想和我的打火機見一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3.1"
msgid "What would the Pig King make of it?"
msgstr "不知道豬王看見它會怎麼想。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3.2"
msgid "I wonder what it looked like when it was new."
msgstr "不知道嶄新時是什麼樣子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_4"
msgid "No idea what that is."
msgstr "完全不知道那是什麼東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_4.1"
msgid "Of all the things to turn up here, the sea worther!"
msgstr "居然會在這裡找到海洋財寶！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_4.2"
msgid "I can always spare one little corner of my pack."
msgstr "背包角落裡總還有點空。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_5"
msgid "Not my size."
msgstr "尺碼不合適。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_5.1"
msgid "Somebody kept it long enough for us to find it."
msgstr "有人把它留了這麼久，才讓我們找到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_5.2"
msgid "I can always spare one little corner of my pack."
msgstr "背包角落裡總還有點空。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_13"
msgid "Is this fire water? It's orange."
msgstr "這是烈酒嗎？是橙色的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_13.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_13.1"
msgid "Somebody kept the orange soda long enough for us to find it."
msgstr "有人把橘子汽水留了這麼久，才讓我們找到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_13.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_13.2"
msgid "Perhaps someone at camp will recognize this."
msgstr "也許營地裡有人認得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_14"
msgid "I don't have any pins..."
msgstr "我沒有針..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_14.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_14.1"
msgid "Takina would ask why I kept the voodoo doll."
msgstr "瀧奈一定會問我為什麼要留著巫毒人偶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_14.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_14.2"
msgid "I wonder what it looked like when it was new."
msgstr "不知道嶄新時是什麼樣子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_15"
msgid "Oh, this would burn."
msgstr "噢，這玩意是可以燒的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_15.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_15.1"
msgid "I'd like to know who once owned the ukulele."
msgstr "我想知道尤克里裡原來是誰的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_15.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_15.2"
msgid "I wonder what it looked like when it was new."
msgstr "不知道嶄新時是什麼樣子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_16"
msgid "Litter is a terrible thing."
msgstr "垃圾是令人討厭的東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_16.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_16.1"
msgid "Takina would ask why I kept the license plate."
msgstr "瀧奈一定會問我為什麼要留著車牌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_16.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_16.2"
msgid "Perhaps someone at camp will recognize this."
msgstr "也許營地裡有人認得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_17"
msgid "Not my style."
msgstr "不是我的風格。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_17.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_17.1"
msgid "Of all the things to turn up here, the old boot!"
msgstr "居然會在這裡找到舊靴子！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_17.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_17.2"
msgid "I can always spare one little corner of my pack."
msgstr "背包角落裡總還有點空。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_18"
msgid "I wonder if this is worth anything?"
msgstr "我想知道這東西有沒有任何價值？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_18.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_18.1"
msgid "What would the Pig King make of the ancient vase?"
msgstr "不知道豬王看見古代花瓶會怎麼想。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_18.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_18.2"
msgid "Perhaps someone at camp will recognize this."
msgstr "也許營地裡有人認得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_19"
msgid "Brain cloud? Sounds tragic."
msgstr "腦雲？聽起來糟透了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_19.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_19.1"
msgid "Of all the things to turn up here, the brain cloud pill!"
msgstr "居然會在這裡找到腦雲丸！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_19.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_19.2"
msgid "I can always spare one little corner of my pack."
msgstr "背包角落裡總還有點空。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_20"
msgid "I can't say that word!"
msgstr "我不能說那個詞！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_20.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_20.1"
msgid "What would the Pig King make of the sextant?"
msgstr "不知道豬王看見六分儀會怎麼想。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_20.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_20.2"
msgid "I wonder what it looked like when it was new."
msgstr "不知道嶄新時是什麼樣子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_21"
msgid "I've put away childish things."
msgstr "我已收起幼稚的東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_21.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_21.1"
msgid "I'd like to know who once owned the toy boat."
msgstr "我想知道玩具船原來是誰的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_21.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_21.2"
msgid "Perhaps someone at camp will recognize this."
msgstr "也許營地裡有人認得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_22
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_22"
msgid "It wants to meet my lighter."
msgstr "它想和我的打火機會個面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_22.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_22.1"
msgid "Takina would ask why I kept the wine bottle candle."
msgstr "瀧奈一定會問我為什麼要留著酒瓶蠟燭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_22.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_22.2"
msgid "Whatever its worth, someone took the trouble to make it."
msgstr "不論值多少錢，畢竟有人認真做過。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_23
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_23"
msgid "Broken what?"
msgstr "壞了什麼？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_23.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_23.1"
msgid "Of all the things to turn up here, the broken aac device!"
msgstr "居然會在這裡找到損壞的溝通輔助裝置！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_23.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_IA_23.2"
msgid "Perhaps someone at camp will recognize this."
msgstr "也許營地裡有人認得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.EARRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.EARRING"
msgid "So shiny!"
msgstr "好閃亮！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARRING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARRING.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the one true earring out here."
msgstr "沒想到能在這裡找到至尊耳環。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARRING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARRING.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻過來看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEACH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEACH"
msgid "The ground is boring."
msgstr "這地面沒什麼特別的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEACH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEACH.1"
msgid "I'd like to try it outside the gate."
msgstr "我想試著把它鋪在門外。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEACH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEACH.2"
msgid "Let's see how it looks beside the old path."
msgstr "看看放在舊路邊是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_JUNGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_JUNGLE"
msgid "The ground is boring."
msgstr "地皮太沒意思了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_JUNGLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_JUNGLE.1"
msgid "I'll lay the jungle turf where the bare ground shows."
msgstr "我把叢林地皮鋪在露土的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_JUNGLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_JUNGLE.2"
msgid "I should line up the edges before I set it down."
msgstr "鋪之前得先對齊邊緣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_MAGMAFIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_MAGMAFIELD"
msgid "Explosive!"
msgstr "易爆！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MAGMAFIELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MAGMAFIELD.1"
msgid "I know that ground by the feel of it underfoot."
msgstr "這種地面，踩上去就認得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MAGMAFIELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MAGMAFIELD.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the nitre if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些硝石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_TIDALMARSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_TIDALMARSH"
msgid "Squelchy."
msgstr "踩上去嘎吱響。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_TIDALMARSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_TIDALMARSH.1"
msgid "I'd like to try the tidal marsh turf outside the gate."
msgstr "我想試著把潮澤地皮鋪在門外。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_TIDALMARSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_TIDALMARSH.2"
msgid "Let's see how it looks beside the old path."
msgstr "看看放在舊路邊是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_ASH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_ASH"
msgid "Ashy."
msgstr "灰燼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ASH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ASH.1"
msgid "I know that ground by the feel of it underfoot."
msgstr "這種地面，踩上去就認得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ASH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ASH.2"
msgid "Let's see how it looks beside the old path."
msgstr "看看放在舊路邊是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_MEADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_MEADOW"
msgid "Serene."
msgstr "寧靜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MEADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MEADOW.1"
msgid "A patch of the meadow turf would change the whole path."
msgstr "鋪一塊草甸地皮，路面就不同了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MEADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MEADOW.2"
msgid "I should line up the edges before I set it down."
msgstr "鋪之前得先對齊邊緣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_VOLCANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_VOLCANO"
msgid "Hot footin'."
msgstr "熱的地皮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VOLCANO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VOLCANO.1"
msgid "I know that ground by the feel of it underfoot."
msgstr "這種地面，踩上去就認得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VOLCANO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VOLCANO.2"
msgid "I should line up the edges before I set it down."
msgstr "鋪之前得先對齊邊緣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_SNAKESKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURF_SNAKESKIN"
msgid "Gross."
msgstr "噁心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SNAKESKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SNAKESKIN.1"
msgid "I'll lay the snakeskin rug where the bare ground shows."
msgstr "我把蛇皮地毯鋪在露土的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SNAKESKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SNAKESKIN.2"
msgid "I could mark the turn in the path with this."
msgstr "可以用這個標出小路轉彎的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BLUE"
msgid "I didn't know they even made fish that big."
msgstr "我都不知道他們竟然把魚做得那麼大。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BLUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BLUE.1"
msgid "That's a whale's trail, sure enough."
msgstr "那的確是鯨魚留下的痕跡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BLUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BLUE.2"
msgid "I ought to watch where the next spout comes up."
msgstr "我得看看下一股水柱從哪裡冒出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_BLUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_BLUE"
msgid "It's starting to spoil. Gross."
msgstr "它開始腐爛了。真噁心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_BLUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_BLUE.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它靜靜躺著，我留點距離。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_BLUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_BLUE.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_WHITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_WHITE"
msgid "I see fire in its eyes!"
msgstr "我在它的眼睛裡看到了火焰！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_WHITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_WHITE.1"
msgid "That's a whale's trail, sure enough."
msgstr "那的確是鯨魚留下的痕跡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_WHITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_WHITE.2"
msgid "I ought to watch where the next spout comes up."
msgstr "我得看看下一股水柱從哪裡冒出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_WHITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_WHITE"
msgid "Victory doesn't smell very good..."
msgstr "勝利的味道不太好聞..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_WHITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_WHITE.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它靜靜躺著，我留點距離。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_WHITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_CARCASS_WHITE.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_TRACK"
msgid "Where there's bubbles there's fire!"
msgstr "哪裡有泡泡哪裡就有火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_TRACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_TRACK.1"
msgid "That's a whale's trail, sure enough."
msgstr "那的確是鯨魚留下的痕跡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_TRACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_TRACK.2"
msgid "I ought to watch where the next spout comes up."
msgstr "我得看看下一股水柱從哪裡冒出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BUBBLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BUBBLES"
msgid "What's making those bubbles?"
msgstr "那些泡泡是怎麼弄出來的？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BUBBLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BUBBLES.1"
msgid "I wonder what the suspicious bubbles looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道這裡剛建成時，可疑的氣泡是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BUBBLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHALE_BUBBLES.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我繞一圈，看得仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BLUBBERSUIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BLUBBERSUIT"
msgid "It squishes when I move..."
msgstr "我一動就發出咯吱咯吱的聲音..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUBBERSUIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUBBERSUIT.1"
msgid "I could wear the blubber suit over my training clothes."
msgstr "練習服外面還能再穿一層鯨脂套裝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUBBERSUIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUBBERSUIT.2"
msgid "I can mend a small tear before it gets worse."
msgstr "小破口要趁還沒扯大時補好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BLUBBER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BLUBBER"
msgid "I bet this burns bright!"
msgstr "我敢打賭這個燒起來一定很亮！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUBBER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUBBER.1"
msgid "I could smell the blubber from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在營地另一頭就聞到了鯨脂的氣味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUBBER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUBBER.2"
msgid "I should save some for the windbreaker."
msgstr "我該給防風衣留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.HARPOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.HARPOON"
msgid "Just need something to throw it at."
msgstr "只需要把它丟出去就可以了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARPOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARPOON.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the harpoon this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是誰想到把魚叉做成這種形狀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARPOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARPOON.2"
msgid "I should make time to practice before I need it."
msgstr "趁還不急用，我該抽空練練。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAIL_PALMLEAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAIL_PALMLEAF"
msgid "It makes use of the wind."
msgstr "它能利用風。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_PALMLEAF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_PALMLEAF.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the thatch sail while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平靜，我看看草帆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_PALMLEAF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_PALMLEAF.2"
msgid "I won't go far from the dock until it's ready."
msgstr "準備妥當前，我不會離碼頭太遠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAIL_CLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAIL_CLOTH"
msgid "Nice stitching."
msgstr "縫得不錯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_CLOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_CLOTH.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the cloth sail."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪時布帆表現如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_CLOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_CLOTH.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the bamboo to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了竹子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAIL_SNAKESKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAIL_SNAKESKIN"
msgid "What a morbid sail."
msgstr "多麼令人毛骨悚然的帆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_SNAKESKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_SNAKESKIN.1"
msgid "I'll check the snakeskin sail before we leave the shore."
msgstr "離岸前我要檢查蛇皮帆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_SNAKESKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_SNAKESKIN.2"
msgid "I won't go far from the dock until it's ready."
msgstr "準備妥當前，我不會離碼頭太遠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAIL_FEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAIL_FEATHER"
msgid "Gotta hand it to those dumdums... they make good sails!"
msgstr "我要好好贊一下那些渡渡鳥...它們用來做帆真不錯！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_FEATHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_FEATHER.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the feather lite sail while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平靜，我看看輕型羽帆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_FEATHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_FEATHER.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the bamboo if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些竹子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.IRONWIND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.IRONWIND"
msgid "Now we're gettin' somewhere."
msgstr "現在總算有點進展了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRONWIND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRONWIND.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the iron wind to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把螺旋槳帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRONWIND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IRONWIND.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了金塊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERMUDATRIANGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERMUDATRIANGLE"
msgid "I feel kinda dizzy looking at it."
msgstr "看著它我感覺有點頭暈。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERMUDATRIANGLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERMUDATRIANGLE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the electric isosceles."
msgstr "我標一下發現電光三角的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERMUDATRIANGLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERMUDATRIANGLE.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也許營地裡有人知道它的來歷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PACKIM_FISHBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PACKIM_FISHBONE"
msgid "This looks meaningful."
msgstr "這看上去意味深長。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PACKIM_FISHBONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PACKIM_FISHBONE.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in the fishbone."
msgstr "瀧奈一定會把魚骨裡的東西列張清單。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PACKIM_FISHBONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PACKIM_FISHBONE.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的東西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PACKIM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PACKIM"
msgid "Friend or foe?"
msgstr "是敵是友？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PACKIM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PACKIM.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the packim baggims."
msgstr "暫時用不到的可以收進鵜鶘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PACKIM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PACKIM.2"
msgid "I'd like one place where my glasses won't get crushed."
msgstr "我想留個不會壓到眼鏡的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TIGERSHARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TIGERSHARK"
msgid "My nightmares have come true!"
msgstr "我的噩夢成真了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIGERSHARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIGERSHARK.1"
msgid "I can just make out the tiger shark from here."
msgstr "我在這裡剛好看得見虎鯊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIGERSHARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIGERSHARK.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "這裡的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MYSTERYMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MYSTERYMEAT"
msgid "Parenting is gross."
msgstr "養育子女真讓人噁心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MYSTERYMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MYSTERYMEAT.1"
msgid "Could we take the bile-covered slop on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能帶著膽汁蓋肉吃嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MYSTERYMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MYSTERYMEAT.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有個盼頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARK_GILLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARK_GILLS"
msgid "I guess it doesn't need to breathe with these anymore."
msgstr "我猜它不再需要用這些來呼吸了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_GILLS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_GILLS.1"
msgid "I'd bring the shark gills back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把鯊魚腮帶回去仔細看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_GILLS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_GILLS.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the dumbrella."
msgstr "要做雙層傘帽，就得用到這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TIGEREYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TIGEREYE"
msgid "Don't look at me like that!"
msgstr "別用那種眼神看我！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIGEREYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIGEREYE.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the eye of the tiger shark."
msgstr "不知道沃利會給虎鯊之眼配什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIGEREYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIGEREYE.2"
msgid "I should save some for the super spyglass."
msgstr "我該給超級望遠鏡留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOUBLE_UMBRELLAHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOUBLE_UMBRELLAHAT"
msgid "If I bought this in a store I'd feel burned."
msgstr "如果我在商店裡買的這個，我會感覺虧大了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOUBLE_UMBRELLAHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOUBLE_UMBRELLAHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the dumbrella."
msgstr "不知道雙層傘帽會不會壓住劉海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOUBLE_UMBRELLAHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOUBLE_UMBRELLAHAT.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the shark gills to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了鯊魚腮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTEN"
msgid "Hey cutie, where's your mom?"
msgstr "嗨，小可愛，你媽媽在哪裡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTEN.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the sharkitten from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安靜的地方觀察貓鯊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTEN.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想擋住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.GENERIC"
msgid "My shark radar is burning."
msgstr "我的鯊魚雷達正在燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the sandy pile looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道這裡剛建成時，沙堆是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我繞一圈，看得仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.INACTIVE"
msgid "Why is this sand dune here?"
msgstr "這個沙丘為什麼在這裡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.INACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.INACTIVE.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the sandy pile."
msgstr "沙堆現在沒什麼動靜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.INACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.INACTIVE.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它沒動，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY1"
msgid "A key to what?"
msgstr "開什麼的鑰匙？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY1.1"
msgid "I'll keep the bone key in its own pocket."
msgstr "骨鑰匙得單獨裝一個口袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY1.2"
msgid "I'd remember which way the teeth point."
msgstr "我得記住鑰匙齒朝哪邊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2"
msgid "Something must be locked up somewhere."
msgstr "某個地方肯定有某個上鎖的東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2.1"
msgid "Somewhere there's a lock made for the golden key."
msgstr "一定有把鎖和金鑰匙配套。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY2.2"
msgid "I'd remember which way the teeth point."
msgstr "我得記住鑰匙齒朝哪邊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY3"
msgid "Another key."
msgstr "另一把鑰匙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY3.1"
msgid "I'll keep the iron key in its own pocket."
msgstr "鐵鑰匙得單獨裝一個口袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_KEY3.2"
msgid "I'd remember which way the teeth point."
msgstr "我得記住鑰匙齒朝哪邊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE"
msgid "He seems a little cagey."
msgstr "他在籠子裡顯得有些拘謹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE.1"
msgid "Can you hear me through the bars, Captain?"
msgstr "船長，隔著欄杆能聽見我嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGS_CAGE.2"
msgid "I'll take a look at those locks."
msgstr "我來看看那幾把鎖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CORAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CORAL"
msgid "Pretty colors."
msgstr "美麗的顏色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL.1"
msgid "I'd set the coral beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把珊瑚放在其他物資旁邊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the anti venom with some of this."
msgstr "說起來，做抗毒血清就能用上這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CORAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CORAL"
msgid "I wish I had a snorkel."
msgstr "真希望有水下呼吸管。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CORAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CORAL.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the coral reef just looking at it."
msgstr "光看著珊瑚礁，就能想見它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CORAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CORAL.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，顏色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONENUGGET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONENUGGET"
msgid "It's made of crushed, dead fishies."
msgstr "它是用碾碎的死魚做的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONENUGGET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONENUGGET.1"
msgid "There's a grain to the limestone if you look closely."
msgstr "仔細看，石灰岩也有紋理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONENUGGET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONENUGGET.2"
msgid "I ought to ask the smith what to make of this."
msgstr "我想問問鐵匠，這東西能怎麼用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NUBBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NUBBIN"
msgid "Nice bald spot, rock."
msgstr "你這塊石頭是個蠻不錯的光禿禿的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUBBIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUBBIN.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the coral nubbin to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把珊瑚礁塊帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUBBIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUBBIN.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the limestone if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些石灰岩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CORALLARVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CORALLARVE"
msgid "Haha, gross."
msgstr "哈哈，好噁心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORALLARVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORALLARVE.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the coral larva in my pack."
msgstr "得在包裡給珊瑚幼蟲騰個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORALLARVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORALLARVE.2"
msgid "I should save some for the coral nubbin."
msgstr "我該給珊瑚礁塊留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE"
msgid "It's all bumpy."
msgstr "凹凸不平的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE.1"
msgid "With the limestone wall here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "這裡有了石灰岩牆，營地的邊界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE.2"
msgid "We'll want an opening wide enough for our beefalo."
msgstr "得留下夠皮弗婁牛通過的開口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE_ITEM"
msgid "You don't look like you would burn easily."
msgstr "你看起來不太好燒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE_ITEM.1"
msgid "With the limestone wall here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "這裡有了石灰岩牆，營地的邊界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE_ITEM.2"
msgid "I can see where the limestone went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了石灰岩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE"
msgid "I feel like this is not the most safe."
msgstr "我覺得這個不是很安全。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE.1"
msgid "I'll check the alignment of the sea wall against the next section."
msgstr "我看看海牆跟下一段齊不齊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE.2"
msgid "We'll want an opening wide enough for our beefalo."
msgstr "得留下夠皮弗婁牛通過的開口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE_ITEM"
msgid "I could put it down, I guess."
msgstr "我猜我能把它放倒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE_ITEM.1"
msgid "With the sea wall here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "這裡有了海牆，營地的邊界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_ENFORCEDLIMESTONE_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the limestone if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些石灰岩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORLIMESTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORLIMESTONE"
msgid "It's so... heavy."
msgstr "好...沉啊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORLIMESTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORLIMESTONE.1"
msgid "I could wear the limestone suit over my training clothes."
msgstr "練習服外面還能再穿一層石灰岩甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORLIMESTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORLIMESTONE.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再檢查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK"
msgid "Genius idea, hiding out with these dumb regular corals."
msgstr "天才的想法，躲在這些愚笨的普通珊瑚當中。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the brainy sprout."
msgstr "我想細看一下智慧樹的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，顏色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN"
msgid "I could learn to love the taste..."
msgstr "我可以學著喜歡這種味道..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the brainy matter to share."
msgstr "希望智慧果夠大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN.2"
msgid "I should save some for the brain of thought."
msgstr "我該給智慧帽留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BRAINJELLYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BRAINJELLYHAT"
msgid "I feel smarter, but also grosser..."
msgstr "我感覺更聰明了，但也覺得更噁心了..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRAINJELLYHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRAINJELLYHAT.1"
msgid "Would the brain of thought leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴著智慧帽還能不能戴眼鏡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRAINJELLYHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRAINJELLYHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜歡眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL"
msgid "Just some stupid seashell."
msgstr "只是一些愚蠢的海貝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL.1"
msgid "I wonder what I could make with the seashell."
msgstr "不知貝殼能做成什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the sand castle."
msgstr "要做沙堡，就得用到這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL_BEACHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL_BEACHED"
msgid "Just some stupid seashell."
msgstr "只是一些愚蠢的海貝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL_BEACHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL_BEACHED.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the seashell again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我們有閒暇，我想再來看看貝殼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL_BEACHED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASHELL_BEACHED.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把筆記本帶來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORSEASHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORSEASHELL"
msgid "Try me, baddies."
msgstr "來試試看啊，壞蛋們。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSEASHELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSEASHELL.1"
msgid "I could wear the seashell suit over my training clothes."
msgstr "練習服外面還能再穿一層海貝甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSEASHELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSEASHELL.2"
msgid "I can mend a small tear before it gets worse."
msgstr "小破口要趁還沒扯大時補好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LIFEJACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LIFEJACKET"
msgid "But will it keep my lighter dry?"
msgstr "但它能讓我的打火機保持乾燥嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LIFEJACKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LIFEJACKET.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the life jacket before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先試過救生衣合不合身，再指望它護著我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LIFEJACKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LIFEJACKET.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cloth if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些布。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_WINDBREAKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_WINDBREAKER"
msgid "Wind is the enemy of fire."
msgstr "風是火的敵人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_WINDBREAKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_WINDBREAKER.1"
msgid "I could wear the windbreaker over my training clothes."
msgstr "練習服外面還能再穿一層防風衣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_WINDBREAKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_WINDBREAKER.2"
msgid "I can mend a small tear before it gets worse."
msgstr "小破口要趁還沒扯大時補好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKE"
msgid "Jerks that slither."
msgstr "滑行的混蛋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the snake from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安靜的地方觀察蛇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "與其追過去，不如靜下來觀察。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_POISON"
msgid "Those are some pointy fangs."
msgstr "那些是尖銳的毒牙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_POISON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_POISON.1"
msgid "I'd label the poison snake before I put it with the supplies."
msgstr "把毒蛇收進物資前，我要先貼好標記。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_POISON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_POISON.2"
msgid "I'd like to know what's in it before I try it."
msgstr "我想先弄清裡頭有什麼再用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN"
msgid "Leathery."
msgstr "絕對真皮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN.1"
msgid "I'd bring the snakeskin back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把蛇皮帶回去仔細看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKIN.2"
msgid "I should save some for the snakeskin hat."
msgstr "我該給蛇皮帽留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL"
msgid "I'm not convinced."
msgstr "我不相信。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the snake oil."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴頓女士對蛇油了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一點的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT"
msgid "Water just runs right off it."
msgstr "水會從它上面流掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the snakeskin hat with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我紮起頭髮試一下蛇皮帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKESKINHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜歡眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SNAKESKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SNAKESKIN"
msgid "This coat makes me feel dangerous."
msgstr "這件衣服讓我感覺很危險。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SNAKESKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SNAKESKIN.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the snakeskin jacket."
msgstr "我想試試穿上蛇皮夾克還能不能靈活轉身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SNAKESKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SNAKESKIN.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再檢查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNING"
msgid "That's how I get rid of the snakes!"
msgstr "那就是我擺脫蛇的方法！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on the viney bush!"
msgstr "藤蔓叢著火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "讓我過去滅火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNT"
msgid "Those were fun to burn!"
msgstr "它們燒起來真好玩！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the viney bush but ash."
msgstr "藤蔓叢只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁邊的東西有沒有保住。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.CHOPPED"
msgid "That's how you untangle them."
msgstr "就該這樣解開它們。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "That's a fresh cut on the viney bush."
msgstr "藤蔓叢的斷面還很新。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留塊空地種棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "I bet these crackle and pop when they burn."
msgstr "我敢打賭這些東西燒起來會噼啪作響。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the viney bush quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近藤蔓叢時輕一些，聽聽裡面有沒有動靜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口讓出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.EMBERS"
msgid "Uh oh. It's almost gone!"
msgstr "啊喔。就快要熄滅了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.EMBERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.EMBERS.1"
msgid "There's hardly a glow left in the obsidian fire pit."
msgstr "黑曜石火坑只剩一點暗紅了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.EMBERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.EMBERS.2"
msgid "I can barely see my hands by this light."
msgstr "借這點光幾乎看不清手了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.GENERIC"
msgid "I could watch it for hours."
msgstr "我可以幾個小時一直盯著它看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the obsidian fire pit."
msgstr "得記住回到黑曜石火坑這裡的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the obsidian to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了黑曜石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.HIGH"
msgid "BURN! BURN FASTER!"
msgstr "燒吧！燒得再旺點！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.HIGH.1"
msgid "I can feel the obsidian fire pit from several paces back."
msgstr "隔著好幾步都能感覺到黑曜石火坑的熱氣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.HIGH.2"
msgid "That's quite enough fuel for now."
msgstr "現在添的燃料夠多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.LOW"
msgid "This fire is small and boring."
msgstr "火太小了，真無聊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.LOW.1"
msgid "I ought to top up the obsidian fire pit."
msgstr "得給黑曜石火坑補些燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.LOW.2"
msgid "A little now will save me trouble later."
msgstr "現在添一些，等一下兒就省事了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.NORMAL"
msgid "I feel so pampered!"
msgstr "我覺得備受寵愛！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.NORMAL.1"
msgid "I could sit beside the obsidian fire pit for a while."
msgstr "我可以在黑曜石火坑旁邊坐一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Just right. No need to feed it yet."
msgstr "這樣正好，暫時不用添燃料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.OUT"
msgid "I should make the fire come back."
msgstr "我應該重新把火點燃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.OUT.1"
msgid "I remember the obsidian fire pit giving rather more light than this."
msgstr "我記得黑曜石火坑亮著時可比這樣有用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANFIREPIT.OUT.2"
msgid "I should find something to light it with."
msgstr "我該找些能引火的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN"
msgid "A fire rock!"
msgstr "一塊火石！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN.1"
msgid "Could we take the obsidian on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能帶著黑曜石吃嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN.2"
msgid "I should save some for the obsidian coconade."
msgstr "我該給黑曜石椰彈留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN"
msgid "The... most... beautiful rock... I've ever... seen..."
msgstr "我...見過的...最...美麗...的石頭..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the obsidian boulder."
msgstr "我想細看一下黑曜石礦的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_OBSIDIAN.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，顏色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN_WORKBENCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN_WORKBENCH"
msgid "Fire items can be forged here!"
msgstr "在這裡可製造火屬性物品！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN_WORKBENCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN_WORKBENCH.1"
msgid "I wonder what the obsidian workbench looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道這裡剛建成時，黑曜石工作台是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN_WORKBENCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIAN_WORKBENCH.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它為什麼偏偏在這個地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANAXE"
msgid "Such an axe! It cuts AND burns?!"
msgstr "這樣一把斧頭！能劈能燒？！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANAXE.1"
msgid "The obsidian axe takes a different grip from my katana."
msgstr "黑曜石斧的握法和我的刀不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANAXE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the axe if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些斧頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANMACHETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANMACHETE"
msgid "A fire machete is a girl's best friend!"
msgstr "火砍刀是女孩最好的朋友！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANMACHETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANMACHETE.1"
msgid "I'll keep the obsidian machete where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我會把黑曜石砍刀放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANMACHETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANMACHETE.2"
msgid "My teacher always checked the fittings first."
msgstr "老師總會先檢查裝具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN"
msgid "I poke. They burn!"
msgstr "一戳就著火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN.1"
msgid "I'll keep the obsidian spear where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我會把黑曜石長矛放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_OBSIDIAN.2"
msgid "I should wipe the handle before I put it away."
msgstr "收好前要把柄擦乾淨。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANOSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANOSTAFF"
msgid "I am the goddess of fiery destruction!"
msgstr "我是主宰熱焰的毀滅之神！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANOSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANOSTAFF.1"
msgid "I'll keep the volcano staff where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我會把火山魔杖放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANOSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANOSTAFF.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得護著，不讓它淋濕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOROBSIDIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOROBSIDIAN"
msgid "Hit me and BURN!"
msgstr "敢碰我就要被燒死！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOROBSIDIAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOROBSIDIAN.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the obsidian armor."
msgstr "我想試試穿上黑曜石護甲還能不能靈活轉身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOROBSIDIAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOROBSIDIAN.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再檢查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.BURNING"
msgid "Here we go..."
msgstr "就是這樣..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on the coconade!"
msgstr "椰子炸彈著火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Quick, before the next thing catches!"
msgstr "快，別讓旁邊也著起來！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.GENERIC"
msgid "First it booms, then it burns."
msgstr "它會先爆炸，再燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the coconade."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴頓女士對椰子炸彈了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the obsidian coconade."
msgstr "要做黑曜石椰彈，就得用到這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.BURNING"
msgid "YESSS!!!"
msgstr "好哇！！！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on the obsidian coconade!"
msgstr "黑曜石椰彈著火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "誰帶了水？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.GENERIC"
msgid "I get more \"boom\" for my buck with obsidian."
msgstr "我用黑曜石增強了它的爆炸威力。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the obsidian coconade to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把黑曜石椰彈帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OBSIDIANCOCONADE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the dragoon heart went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了呆龍心臟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "An altar to the sate the fire gods!"
msgstr "侍奉火神的祭壇！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the volcano altar of snackrifice here."
msgstr "有人費了好大工夫，才把火山祭壇留在這裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在這裡安靜站一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.OPEN"
msgid "Ready to consume the fire!"
msgstr "準備給火焰獻祭！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.OPEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.OPEN.1"
msgid "There's a way through the volcano altar of snackrifice now."
msgstr "現在能從火山祭壇這裡過去了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.OPEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR.OPEN.2"
msgid "I should see where this leads."
msgstr "我去看看到底通向哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO"
msgid "The biggest, fieriest fire in all the land!"
msgstr "所有土地上最大最暴烈的火焰！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the volcano."
msgstr "得記住回到火山這裡的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我該簡單畫個草圖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_EXIT"
msgid "I'd hate to leave this place..."
msgstr "我討厭離開這個地方..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_EXIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_EXIT.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the volcano exit."
msgstr "從火山出口回去的路得記牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_EXIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_EXIT.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我記一下最近的避風處在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CHARCOAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CHARCOAL"
msgid "Charrific!"
msgstr "全是炭！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CHARCOAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CHARCOAL.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the charcoal boulder."
msgstr "我想細看一下木炭礦的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CHARCOAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_CHARCOAL.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，顏色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB"
msgid "No fair! I didn't get to burn you!"
msgstr "不公平！我沒機會燒你！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the burnt ash tree."
msgstr "得記住回到灰燼樹這裡的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_SHRUB.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它為什麼偏偏在這個地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL"
msgid "What marvelous heat and fury!"
msgstr "多麼驚人的熱與怒！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the lava pool."
msgstr "從岩漿池回去的路得記牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAPOOL.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先別走到看不見來路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN"
msgid "It's dripped its last drop."
msgstr "它完全被榨乾了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN.1"
msgid "I hate seeing the coffee plant in this condition."
msgstr "看到咖啡叢成了這樣，真讓人難受。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看這裡的土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.WITHERED"
msgid "It needs ash and love. Mostly just ash."
msgstr "它需要灰燼和愛。主要是灰燼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.WITHERED.1"
msgid "I should tend to the coffee plant before I leave."
msgstr "離開前得照料一下咖啡叢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.WITHERED.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看這裡的土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.GENERIC"
msgid "Hot java from hot lava!"
msgstr "來自熱熔岩的熱爪哇咖啡！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the coffee plant for my notes."
msgstr "我想把咖啡叢的樣子畫進筆記。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根邊走，得留意腳下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.PICKED"
msgid "Aw, but I wanted another cup..."
msgstr "呃，但我還想再來一杯..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the coffee plant time to grow back."
msgstr "得給咖啡叢些時間重新生長。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路過我再來看看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS"
msgid "These could use fire."
msgstr "這些用得上火。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS.1"
msgid "I'll grind these just before I brew them."
msgstr "要煮之前再磨。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS.2"
msgid "There's enough for a cup to share."
msgstr "夠煮一杯，分著喝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS_COOKED"
msgid "Ahhh, that aroma."
msgstr "啊，太香了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'll grind these just before I brew them."
msgstr "要煮之前再磨。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBEANS_COOKED.2"
msgid "There's enough for a cup to share."
msgstr "夠煮一杯，分著喝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DUG_COFFEEBUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DUG_COFFEEBUSH"
msgid "I know just what to do with you."
msgstr "我知道該怎麼對你。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_COFFEEBUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_COFFEEBUSH.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the coffee plant growing near camp."
msgstr "我想讓咖啡叢長在營地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_COFFEEBUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_COFFEEBUSH.2"
msgid "I'd better find a place where no one will tread on it."
msgstr "得找處沒人會踩的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COFFEE"
msgid "I suddenly feel motivated."
msgstr "我突然感覺有動力了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEE.1"
msgid "That smell alone has me sitting up straighter."
msgstr "光聞到香味，我就坐直了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COFFEE.2"
msgid "A small cup before morning practice would be lovely."
msgstr "晨練前來一小杯就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.BARREN"
msgid "It couldn't take the heat."
msgstr "它受不了寒冷。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.BARREN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.BARREN.1"
msgid "I should tend to the elephant cactus before I leave."
msgstr "離開前得照料一下象仙人掌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.BARREN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.BARREN.2"
msgid "The leaves have lost their spring."
msgstr "葉片已經蔫了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.WITHERED"
msgid "It couldn't take the heat."
msgstr "它受不了寒冷。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.WITHERED.1"
msgid "I hate seeing the elephant cactus in this condition."
msgstr "看到象仙人掌成了這樣，真讓人難受。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.WITHERED.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看這裡的土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.GENERIC"
msgid "Don't rub up against me!"
msgstr "別碰我！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd give the elephant cactus a little room to pass."
msgstr "我給象仙人掌讓一點路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下風處看得更仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.PICKED"
msgid "Its stupid spikes are picked."
msgstr "它愚蠢的尖刺已經被拔了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.PICKED.1"
msgid "There's nothing left to pick from the elephant cactus today."
msgstr "今天從象仙人掌上已經摘不到東西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS.PICKED.2"
msgid "Best to leave the roots undisturbed now."
msgstr "這時候還是別動根了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DUG_ELEPHANTCACTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DUG_ELEPHANTCACTUS"
msgid "I don't have to water you, right?"
msgstr "我不必給你澆水，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_ELEPHANTCACTUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_ELEPHANTCACTUS.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the elephant cactus."
msgstr "我知道有塊地適合象仙人掌根。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_ELEPHANTCACTUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_ELEPHANTCACTUS.2"
msgid "A little earth around the roots should help."
msgstr "給根邊培些土會好一點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_ACTIVE"
msgid "Yowch!"
msgstr "哎喲！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_ACTIVE.1"
msgid "Even from here I can see the lash marks in the sand."
msgstr "從這裡也能看清沙地上抽打的痕跡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_ACTIVE.2"
msgid "I'd give that cactus a good wide berth."
msgstr "我還是繞開那株仙人掌吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_STUMP"
msgid "And stay down!"
msgstr "永遠別出來！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_STUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_STUMP.1"
msgid "Even from here I can see the lash marks in the sand."
msgstr "從這裡也能看清沙地上抽打的痕跡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_STUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_STUMP.2"
msgid "I'd give that cactus a good wide berth."
msgstr "我還是繞開那株仙人掌吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NEEDLESPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.NEEDLESPEAR"
msgid "I could jabber on about this all day."
msgstr "談到這玩意我可以說上一整天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEEDLESPEAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEEDLESPEAR.1"
msgid "I'll keep the cactus spike where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我會把仙人掌刺放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEEDLESPEAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NEEDLESPEAR.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得護著，不讓它淋濕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORCACTUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMORCACTUS"
msgid "This way I won't get burned by those cacti."
msgstr "這樣我就不會被那些仙人掌扎到了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORCACTUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORCACTUS.1"
msgid "I could wear the cactus armor over my training clothes."
msgstr "練習服外面還能再穿一層仙人掌護甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORCACTUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORCACTUS.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the cactus spike to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了仙人掌刺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TWISTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TWISTER"
msgid "Stay away from my precious flames!"
msgstr "離我寶貴的火焰遠點！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWISTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWISTER.1"
msgid "Look, the sealnado has noticed us."
msgstr "看，豹捲風注意到我們了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWISTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWISTER.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想擋住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TWISTER_SEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TWISTER_SEAL"
msgid "I've been burned by cute things before."
msgstr "我以前也被很萌的傢伙弄得焦頭爛額過。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWISTER_SEAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWISTER_SEAL.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the seal before it moves again."
msgstr "趁海豹沒動，我想畫下它的樣子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWISTER_SEAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWISTER_SEAL.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "剛才好像有什麼讓它轉了身。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURBINE_BLADES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TURBINE_BLADES"
msgid "What do these do?"
msgstr "這些有什麼用？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURBINE_BLADES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURBINE_BLADES.1"
msgid "I want to see how they put the turbine blades together."
msgstr "我想知道渦輪葉片是怎麼組裝的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURBINE_BLADES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURBINE_BLADES.2"
msgid "I'd ask before I took the cover off."
msgstr "拆開外殼之前我會先問一聲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAGIC_SEAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAGIC_SEAL"
msgid "It's so glowy."
msgstr "它在發光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGIC_SEAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGIC_SEAL.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the magic seal in my pack."
msgstr "得在包裡給魔法豹印騰個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGIC_SEAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGIC_SEAL.2"
msgid "I should save some for the sail stick."
msgstr "我該給帆杆留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIND_CONCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WIND_CONCH"
msgid "Hope no fires get blown out."
msgstr "希望不會把火吹滅。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIND_CONCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIND_CONCH.1"
msgid "I'd set the howling conch beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把咆哮海螺放在其他物資旁邊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIND_CONCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WIND_CONCH.2"
msgid "I can see where the purple gem went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了紫寶石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINDSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINDSTAFF"
msgid "I'm the queen of this boooooat!"
msgstr "我是這艘船的女王！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDSTAFF.1"
msgid "I'd like to feel the balance of the sail stick."
msgstr "我想掂一下帆杆的重心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINDSTAFF.2"
msgid "I can see where the obsidian went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了黑曜石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGOON"
msgid "If only I could figure out how to train one."
msgstr "要是我能想出怎麼馴服一隻就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOON.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the dragoon?"
msgstr "呆龍平時也是這樣活動的嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOON.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下風處看得更仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONHEART"
msgid "Nothing like a hot meal."
msgstr "沒什麼比一餐熱飯更好的了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONHEART.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONHEART.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the dragoon heart aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一點呆龍心臟給客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONHEART.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONHEART.2"
msgid "I should save some for the obsidian armor."
msgstr "我該給黑曜石護甲留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT"
msgid "A burning puddle of hork."
msgstr "一攤燃燒著的嘔吐物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the dragoon saliva."
msgstr "得記住回到呆龍唾液這裡的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONSPIT.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "從另一邊還能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONEGG"
msgid "I think this hot rock is actually a hot egg."
msgstr "我想這塊熱石頭實際上是一顆熱乎乎的蛋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONEGG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONEGG.1"
msgid "I wouldn't risk dropping the dragoon egg on the way back."
msgstr "帶呆龍蛋回去的時候得拿穩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONEGG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONEGG.2"
msgid "I'd carry it cupped in both hands."
msgstr "最好用雙手捧著。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONDEN"
msgid "A bunch of hotheads live there."
msgstr "一群莽夫住在那裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONDEN.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at the dragoon den today."
msgstr "不知道今天呆龍巢穴裡有沒有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGOONDEN.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不該站在門口擋路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.OUT"
msgid "It's out of fuel."
msgstr "它沒有燃料了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.OUT.1"
msgid "I remember the ice maker 3000 giving rather more light than this."
msgstr "我記得製冰機3000亮著時可比這樣有用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.OUT.2"
msgid "We'll have to light it again."
msgstr "得重新點起來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.VERYLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.VERYLOW"
msgid "It's nearly out of fuel."
msgstr "它差不多沒有燃料了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.VERYLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.VERYLOW.1"
msgid "There's not much left to keep the ice maker 3000 going."
msgstr "夠製冰機3000用的燃料不多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.VERYLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.VERYLOW.2"
msgid "A little now will save me trouble later."
msgstr "現在添一些，等一下兒就省事了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.LOW"
msgid "It needs more fuel."
msgstr "它需要更多燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.LOW.1"
msgid "There's not much left to keep the ice maker 3000 going."
msgstr "夠製冰機3000用的燃料不多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.LOW.2"
msgid "A little now will save me trouble later."
msgstr "現在添一些，等一下兒就省事了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.NORMAL"
msgid "Make that ice."
msgstr "製冰吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.NORMAL.1"
msgid "I could sit beside the ice maker 3000 for a while."
msgstr "我可以在製冰機3000旁邊坐一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Just right. No need to feed it yet."
msgstr "這樣正好，暫時不用添燃料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.HIGH"
msgid "It's fully fueled!"
msgstr "燃料充足！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.HIGH.1"
msgid "I can feel the ice maker 3000 from several paces back."
msgstr "隔著好幾步都能感覺到製冰機3000的熱氣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEMAKER.HIGH.2"
msgid "That's quite enough fuel for now."
msgstr "現在添的燃料夠多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.HAIL_ICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.HAIL_ICE"
msgid "Ugh, just melt already."
msgstr "呃，已經在融化了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAIL_ICE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAIL_ICE.1"
msgid "I could smell the hail from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在營地另一頭就聞到了冰雹的氣味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAIL_ICE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAIL_ICE.2"
msgid "I should save some for the ice."
msgstr "我該給冰留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNING"
msgid "Yesss, YESSS!"
msgstr "對~，就這樣！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "The fire's spreading over the bamboo patch!"
msgstr "火快把竹叢吞沒了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Quick, before the next thing catches!"
msgstr "快，別讓旁邊也著起來！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNT"
msgid "Aww, can I burn it again?"
msgstr "喔，我能再燒一次嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the bamboo patch before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能趕在起火前來到竹叢旁邊就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "這裡得從頭再來了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "It'll come back."
msgstr "它會長回來的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "That's a fresh cut on the bamboo patch."
msgstr "竹叢的斷面還很新。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留塊空地種棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "Kindling!"
msgstr "引火柴！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the bamboo patch changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看換季時竹叢會有什麼變化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOOTREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方讓它長開。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAMBOO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAMBOO"
msgid "Looks flammable."
msgstr "看上去可以燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOO.1"
msgid "I wonder what the bamboo looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道這裡剛建成時，竹子是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAMBOO.2"
msgid "I should save some for the speargun."
msgstr "我該給矛槍留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FABRIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FABRIC"
msgid "Amazing what you can do with bamboo."
msgstr "竹子的用處真讓人驚奇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FABRIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FABRIC.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the cloth in my pack."
msgstr "得在包裡給布騰個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FABRIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FABRIC.2"
msgid "I should save some for the gas mask."
msgstr "我該給防毒面具留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DUG_BAMBOOTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DUG_BAMBOOTREE"
msgid "You need ground, fast."
msgstr "你需要土壤，立刻就需要。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BAMBOOTREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BAMBOOTREE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the bamboo root growing near camp."
msgstr "我想讓竹根長在營地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BAMBOOTREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BAMBOOTREE.2"
msgid "A little earth around the roots should help."
msgstr "給根邊培些土會好一點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNING"
msgid "Wow! So much fire!"
msgstr "哇！好多火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on the jungle tree!"
msgstr "叢林樹著火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "The smoke's getting in my eyes!"
msgstr "煙燻得我睜不開眼！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNT"
msgid "A major improvement."
msgstr "重大改進。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the jungle tree stood."
msgstr "叢林樹原先的位置燒得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等餘燼冷了我再來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "That took a few swings."
msgstr "好幾下才把它砍倒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "That's a fresh cut on the jungle tree."
msgstr "叢林樹的斷面還很新。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留塊空地種棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a whole lot of tree to burn!"
msgstr "好多好多的樹可以燒！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the jungle tree for my notes."
msgstr "我想把叢林樹的樣子畫進筆記。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方讓它長開。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED"
msgid "A future forest fire."
msgstr "未來的森林火災。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the jungle tree seed for my notes."
msgstr "我想把叢林樹種的樣子畫進筆記。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回來看看有何變化。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED_SAPLING"
msgid "A not-so-distant future forest fire."
msgstr "不那麼遙遠的未來森林火災。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the jungle tree sapling."
msgstr "我知道有塊地適合叢林樹苗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNGLETREESEED_SAPLING.2"
msgid "I'll give the roots room to spread."
msgstr "給根留點長開的空間。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LIVINGJUNGLETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LIVINGJUNGLETREE"
msgid "There's something odd about this tree."
msgstr "這棵樹有點奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGJUNGLETREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGJUNGLETREE.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the regular jungle tree grows."
msgstr "我要記住中規中矩的叢林樹長在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGJUNGLETREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGJUNGLETREE.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回來看看有何變化。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OX"
msgid "You look pretty sturdy."
msgstr "你看起來很強壯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the water beefalo?"
msgstr "水牛平時也是這樣活動的嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先別動，看看它接下來做什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BABYOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BABYOX"
msgid "You may be small, but you smell big."
msgstr "你個子不大，但氣味不小。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYOX.1"
msgid "Look, the baby water beefalo has noticed us."
msgstr "看，小水牛注意到我們了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYOX.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想擋住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN"
msgid "I could use an ox-tra one of these."
msgstr "這個可以再來一支。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN.1"
msgid "I'll keep the horn apart from the food in my pack."
msgstr "水牛角得和背包裡的食物分開收。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_HORN.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the dripple pipes."
msgstr "要做滴水排簫，就得用到這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OXHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OXHAT"
msgid "Ox-cellent!"
msgstr "太牛了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OXHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OXHAT.1"
msgid "Would the horned helmet leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴著牛角盔還能不能戴眼鏡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OXHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OXHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出門前我想先照一下鏡子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE"
msgid "I hear a storm a-coming."
msgstr "我聽到有風暴即將來臨。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the dripple pipes to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把滴水排簫帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OX_FLUTE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the nightmare fuel to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了噩夢燃料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_POISON"
msgid "Shoo! Away!"
msgstr "噓！走開！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_POISON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_POISON.1"
msgid "I should ask what dose of the poison mosquito is safe."
msgstr "我得問問毒蚊子用多少才合適。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_POISON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO_POISON.2"
msgid "I'll keep it away from the cooking things."
msgstr "得和做飯的東西分開放。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK_YELLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK_YELLOW"
msgid "Something disgusting dropped this."
msgstr "某個令人厭惡的傢伙掉落了這個。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK_YELLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK_YELLOW.1"
msgid "I'd set the yellow mosquito sack beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把毒蚊血囊放在其他物資旁邊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK_YELLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK_YELLOW.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在這裡多久了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STUNGRAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.STUNGRAY"
msgid "Now I've smelled everything."
msgstr "這回我算是什麼味道都聞過了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUNGRAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUNGRAY.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the stink ray from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安靜的地方觀察惡臭蝠鱝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUNGRAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUNGRAY.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先別動，看看它接下來做什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POISONHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POISONHOLE"
msgid "Nature is so gross."
msgstr "大自然真噁心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONHOLE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the poisonous hole by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清毒穴，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONHOLE.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先別走到看不見來路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GASHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GASHAT"
msgid "I like not smelling smelly smells."
msgstr "我不喜歡聞臭臭的味道。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASHAT.1"
msgid "Would the particulate purifier leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴著顆粒淨化器還能不能戴眼鏡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GASHAT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the empty bottle if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些空瓶子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTIVENOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANTIVENOM"
msgid "This'll help if I'm poisoned."
msgstr "在我中毒的時候這個能派上用場。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTIVENOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTIVENOM.1"
msgid "I'd label the anti venom before I put it with the supplies."
msgstr "把抗毒血清收進物資前，我要先貼好標記。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTIVENOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTIVENOM.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the venom gland if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些毒腺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND"
msgid "Gross! I wish I had gloves."
msgstr "好噁心！我要是有手套就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the venom gland to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把毒腺帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VENOMGLAND.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the anti venom."
msgstr "要做抗毒血清，就得用到這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POISONBALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POISONBALM"
msgid "A gross, smelly goop."
msgstr "又臭又黏的一團。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONBALM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONBALM.1"
msgid "I should ask what dose of the poison balm is safe."
msgstr "我得問問解毒膏用多少才合適。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONBALM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POISONBALM.2"
msgid "I'll keep it away from the cooking things."
msgstr "得和做飯的東西分開放。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_POISON"
msgid "I hope I don't jab myself."
msgstr "我希望不要戳到自己。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_POISON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_POISON.1"
msgid "The poison spear takes a different grip from my katana."
msgstr "毒矛的握法和我的刀不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_POISON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_POISON.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得護著，不讓它淋濕。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_POISON"
msgid "A sick kiss."
msgstr "致命一吻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_POISON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_POISON.1"
msgid "I'll put a cover over the point before I carry it."
msgstr "帶走前我會先把尖端套住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_POISON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_POISON.2"
msgid "The shaft is so light I can barely feel it in my sleeve."
msgstr "細杆真輕，放在袖袋裡幾乎感覺不到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARX"
msgid "Jerks that swim."
msgstr "游泳的蠢貨。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARX.1"
msgid "Look, the sea hound has noticed us."
msgstr "看，海獵犬注意到我們了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARX.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "與其追過去，不如靜下來觀察。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARK_FIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARK_FIN"
msgid "The fin fell off."
msgstr "鰭掉下來了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_FIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_FIN.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the shark fin aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一點魚翅給客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_FIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_FIN.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the sleek hat."
msgstr "要做流線型帽子，就得用到這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP"
msgid "And I didn't even burn it!"
msgstr "我甚至沒有燒它！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP.1"
msgid "I wonder if Warly would season the shark fin soup differently."
msgstr "不知道沃利會怎麼給魚翅湯調味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP.2"
msgid "I'll get the plates out."
msgstr "我去取盤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARK_TEETHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHARK_TEETHHAT"
msgid "Wearing this gives me a toothy grin."
msgstr "戴著這個讓我露齒而笑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_TEETHHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_TEETHHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the shark tooth crown."
msgstr "不知道鯊齒王冠會不會壓住劉海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_TEETHHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK_TEETHHAT.2"
msgid "I can see where the hound's tooth went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了犬牙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.AERODYNAMICHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.AERODYNAMICHAT"
msgid "Brisk movement snuffs fires."
msgstr "走得太快火會熄掉的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AERODYNAMICHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AERODYNAMICHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the sleek hat."
msgstr "不知道流線型帽子會不會壓住劉海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AERODYNAMICHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AERODYNAMICHAT.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the shark fin to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了魚翅。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE"
msgid "Bottled paper!"
msgstr "裝在瓶子裡的紙條！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE.1"
msgid "I want a quiet moment to look over the message in a bottle."
msgstr "我想靜下來仔細看看漂流瓶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLE.2"
msgid "The writing's easier to see in daylight."
msgstr "日光下字跡清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY"
msgid "It's a bottle."
msgstr "一個瓶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.1"
msgid "I want a quiet moment to look over the empty bottle."
msgstr "我想靜下來仔細看看空瓶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.2"
msgid "The writing's easier to see in daylight."
msgstr "日光下字跡清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BURIEDTREASURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BURIEDTREASURE"
msgid "If I don't like the treasure I'll just set the chest on fire."
msgstr "如果我不喜歡裡面的東西，我就把箱子燒了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURIEDTREASURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURIEDTREASURE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the x marks the spot in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的X標記點。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURIEDTREASURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURIEDTREASURE.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我該簡單畫個草圖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAND"
msgid "Big deal, it's sand."
msgstr "有什麼了不起，就是沙子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAND.1"
msgid "I'd set the sand beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把沙放在其他物資旁邊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAND.2"
msgid "I should save some for the empty bottle."
msgstr "我該給空瓶子留一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDDUNE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDDUNE"
msgid "Oh, look! It's some sand."
msgstr "喔，看！一些沙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDDUNE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDDUNE.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the sandy pile."
msgstr "得記住回到沙堆這裡的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDDUNE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDDUNE.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也許營地裡有人知道它的來歷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL"
msgid "Keeps the home fires burning."
msgstr "家裡的爐火能接著燒了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL.1"
msgid "With it here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "這裡有了它，營地的邊界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL.2"
msgid "We'll want an opening wide enough for our beefalo."
msgstr "得留下夠皮弗婁牛通過的開口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL_ITEM"
msgid "Keeps the home fires burning."
msgstr "家裡的爐火能接著燒了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll check the alignment of it against the next section."
msgstr "我看看它跟下一段齊不齊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBAGSMALL_ITEM.2"
msgid "We'll want an opening wide enough for our beefalo."
msgstr "得留下夠皮弗婁牛通過的開口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.SAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.SAND"
msgid "It's a castle made of sand. A sandcastle."
msgstr "沙子做的城堡。一座沙堡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.SAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.SAND.1"
msgid "Each little tower has been pressed into shape."
msgstr "每座小塔都是用沙壓出來的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.SAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.SAND.2"
msgid "I hope the tide leaves it standing a while."
msgstr "希望海潮能讓它多留一陣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's cute, I guess."
msgstr "應該蠻可愛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the sand castle."
msgstr "得記住回到沙堡這裡的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDCASTLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the palm leaf went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了椰樹葉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE"
msgid "I can see to the ends of the earth."
msgstr "我能看到大地的盡頭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the super spyglass to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把超級望遠鏡帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTELESCOPE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the eye of the tiger shark if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些虎鯊之眼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELESCOPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELESCOPE"
msgid "You can't hide from me now, islands!"
msgstr "現在你躲不了了，海島！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESCOPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESCOPE.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the spyglass to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把望遠鏡帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESCOPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESCOPE.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the super spyglass with some of this."
msgstr "說起來，做超級望遠鏡就能用上這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOY"
msgid "There is no spark behind its eyes."
msgstr "它的眼裡沒有火花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOY.1"
msgid "Look, the doydoy has noticed us."
msgstr "看，渡渡鳥注意到我們了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOY.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "與其追過去，不如靜下來觀察。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYBABY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYBABY"
msgid "You poor little dummy."
msgstr "你個可憐的小笨蛋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYBABY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYBABY.1"
msgid "I should mind my boots near those tiny feet."
msgstr "在那雙小腳邊走，我得留意自己的靴子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYBABY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYBABY.2"
msgid "Come along, little bird. That's no place to wander."
msgstr "來，小鳥。那可不是閒逛的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG"
msgid "Dumb egg."
msgstr "笨 蛋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG.1"
msgid "I wouldn't risk dropping the doydoy egg on the way back."
msgstr "帶渡渡鳥蛋回去的時候得拿穩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG.2"
msgid "The shell's thinner than it looks."
msgstr "殼比看起來的薄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG_CRACKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG_CRACKED"
msgid "The planet just got a little dumber."
msgstr "這世上又多了個小笨蛋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG_CRACKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG_CRACKED.1"
msgid "I wouldn't risk dropping it on the way back."
msgstr "帶它回去的時候得拿穩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG_CRACKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYEGG_CRACKED.2"
msgid "The shell's thinner than it looks."
msgstr "殼比看起來的薄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYFEATHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYFEATHER"
msgid "This would burn."
msgstr "這玩意是可以燒的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYFEATHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYFEATHER.1"
msgid "I can see every fine strand on the doydoy feather."
msgstr "渡渡鳥羽毛上的細紋一根根都看得清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYFEATHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYFEATHER.2"
msgid "So much colour in something that weighs so little."
msgstr "這麼輕的東西，顏色卻如此鮮明。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYNEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYNEST"
msgid "A dummy is born every second."
msgstr "每秒鐘出生一個笨蛋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYNEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYNEST.1"
msgid "I'd approach the doydoy nest quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近渡渡鳥巢時輕一些，聽聽裡面有沒有動靜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYNEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOYDOYNEST.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口讓出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TROPICALFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TROPICALFAN"
msgid "I dunno... it could put out some fires..."
msgstr "我不知道...它可以滅火..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPICALFAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPICALFAN.1"
msgid "I want to see how they put the tropical fan together."
msgstr "我想知道熱帶風扇是怎麼組裝的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPICALFAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPICALFAN.2"
msgid "I'm better with a blade than a set of gears."
msgstr "比起齒輪，我還是更熟悉刀具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNING"
msgid "Wooow! So much fire!"
msgstr "哇！好多火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "The fire's spreading over the palm tree!"
msgstr "火快把椰樹吞沒了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "誰帶了水？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNT"
msgid "A major improvement."
msgstr "重大改進。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the palm tree."
msgstr "椰樹燒成這樣，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁邊的東西有沒有保住。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "That took a few swings."
msgstr "好幾下才把它砍倒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "That's a fresh cut on the palm tree."
msgstr "椰樹的斷面還很新。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留塊空地種棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "You have a curious lack of branches."
msgstr "你的樹枝少得出奇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the palm tree grows."
msgstr "我要記住椰樹長在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMTREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回來看看有何變化。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONUT"
msgid "An edible tree thing."
msgstr "可以吃的樹生東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT.1"
msgid "I'd save the coconut for after practice."
msgstr "我想把椰子留到練習結束後。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the sleek hat with some of this."
msgstr "說起來，做流線型帽子就能用上這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_HALVED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_HALVED"
msgid "Aha! Now you're food!"
msgstr "啊哈！現在你成食物了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_HALVED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_HALVED.1"
msgid "Two neat halves. Shall we share?"
msgstr "整整齊齊的兩半，我們分了好嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_HALVED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_HALVED.2"
msgid "I can scrape the white flesh out with a spoon."
msgstr "我能用勺子把白色的果肉刮出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_COOKED"
msgid "Mmmm, toasty."
msgstr "嘖~ 熱烘烘的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the roasted coconut before I saw it."
msgstr "還沒看見烤椰子，先聞到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "為一口熱食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_SAPLING"
msgid "Hurry up and grow, I want the shade."
msgstr "快點長大，我想要樹蔭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the palm tree sapling."
msgstr "我知道有塊地適合椰樹苗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COCONUT_SAPLING.2"
msgid "I'd better find a place where no one will tread on it."
msgstr "得找處沒人會踩的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF"
msgid "You'll burn."
msgstr "你將燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the palm leaf to share."
msgstr "希望椰樹葉夠大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the sand castle with some of this."
msgstr "說起來，做沙堡就能用上這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_UMBRELLA"
msgid "It's so nice!"
msgstr "真漂亮！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_UMBRELLA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_UMBRELLA.1"
msgid "I'd set the palm leaf umbrella beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把熱帶陽傘放在其他物資旁邊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_UMBRELLA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_UMBRELLA.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the twigs if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些樹枝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_HUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_HUT"
msgid "Keeps the elements away, but it would burn so easy."
msgstr "遮風擋雨。但太好燒了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_HUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_HUT.1"
msgid "I'd approach the palm leaf hut quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近椰樹葉棚時輕一些，聽聽裡面有沒有動靜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_HUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMLEAF_HUT.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the palm leaf to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了椰樹葉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LEIF_PALM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LEIF_PALM"
msgid "I don't like you. You don't like me."
msgstr "我不喜歡你。你不喜歡我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_PALM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_PALM.1"
msgid "That tree just turned to face me."
msgstr "那棵樹剛才轉過來面對我了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_PALM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_PALM.2"
msgid "I'll put the axe away and back off slowly."
msgstr "我先收起斧頭，慢慢退開。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRAB.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRAB.GENERIC"
msgid "Stop running away!"
msgstr "別再逃了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRAB.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRAB.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can see the crabbit through the water."
msgstr "隔著水也看得見兔蟹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRAB.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRAB.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll stay still until the surface clears."
msgstr "我站穩不動，等水面清下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRAB.HIDDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRAB.HIDDEN"
msgid "I'm pretty sure a crabbit is hiding there."
msgstr "我相當肯定有一隻螃蟹藏在那裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRAB.HIDDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRAB.HIDDEN.1"
msgid "I can just tell where the crabbit is hiding."
msgstr "還能看出兔蟹藏在什麼地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRAB.HIDDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRAB.HIDDEN.2"
msgid "There's movement under the surface."
msgstr "底下有東西在動。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRABHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRABHOLE"
msgid "Come out and play with me!"
msgstr "出來和我一起玩吧！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABHOLE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the crabbit den by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清兔蟹洞，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABHOLE.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近邊緣先看清腳下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON"
msgid "It's going to sink soon!"
msgstr "它很快就要沉下去了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON.1"
msgid "Grab the net before it slips below the surface."
msgstr "趁網還沒沉下去，快抓住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOON.2"
msgid "I can still see the floats from here."
msgstr "從這裡還能看見浮子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH"
msgid "I believe that bag is sinking."
msgstr "我相信那個網袋正在下沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH.1"
msgid "Grab the net before it slips below the surface."
msgstr "趁網還沒沉下去，快抓住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.SOONISH.2"
msgid "I can still see the floats from here."
msgstr "從這裡還能看見浮子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC"
msgid "What's in the baaaag?"
msgstr "網袋裡有什麼？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Grab the net before it slips below the surface."
msgstr "趁網還沒沉下去，快抓住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNETDROPPED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can still see the floats from here."
msgstr "從這裡還能看見浮子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET"
msgid "I'll catch a bunch of wet stuff with this."
msgstr "我會用這個撈到一堆濕東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the trawl net to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把拖網帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAWLNET.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the rope to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了繩子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.IA_TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.IA_TRIDENT"
msgid "This is all wet."
msgstr "從上到下都是濕的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_TRIDENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_TRIDENT.1"
msgid "I'd put the trident within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行裝時，我會把三叉戟放在順手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_TRIDENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IA_TRIDENT.2"
msgid "A dry handle makes all the difference."
msgstr "柄乾燥，握起來就穩多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN"
msgid "Kill it with fire!"
msgstr "用火燒死它！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the quacken?"
msgstr "海妖平時也是這樣活動的嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想擋住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.KRAKENCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.KRAKENCHEST"
msgid "Don't mind if I do."
msgstr "我就不客氣了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKENCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKENCHEST.1"
msgid "I ought to check what's already in the chest of the depths."
msgstr "該檢查一下深淵寶箱裡已經裝了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKENCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKENCHEST.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道備用物資收在哪裡，總歸省心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN_TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN_TENTACLE"
msgid "Eww, stay away!"
msgstr "哎呀，離我遠點！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN_TENTACLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN_TENTACLE.1"
msgid "I'd give the quacken tentacle a little room to pass."
msgstr "我給海妖觸手讓一點路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN_TENTACLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAKEN_TENTACLE.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先別動，看看它接下來做什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUACKENBEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUACKENBEAK"
msgid "Never stick your beak where it doesn't belong."
msgstr "別把你的嘴巴伸向不該伸的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKENBEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKENBEAK.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the quacken beak out here."
msgstr "沒想到能在這裡找到海妖之喙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKENBEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKENBEAK.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the quacken drill."
msgstr "要做海妖鑽子，就得用到這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUACKENDRILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUACKENDRILL"
msgid "I can use this drill at sea."
msgstr "我可以在海上使用這個鑽頭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKENDRILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKENDRILL.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the quacken drill in my pack."
msgstr "得在包裡給海妖鑽子騰個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKENDRILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKENDRILL.2"
msgid "I can see where the quacken beak went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了海妖之喙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUACKERINGRAM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUACKERINGRAM"
msgid "Can't stop me now!"
msgstr "現在擋不住我了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKERINGRAM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKERINGRAM.1"
msgid "I'd bring the quackering ram back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把海妖撞錘帶回去仔細看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKERINGRAM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUACKERINGRAM.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the bamboo if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些竹子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK"
msgid "Magma-nificent!"
msgstr "岩漿，我喜歡！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the magma pile."
msgstr "我想細看一下熔岩礦堆的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK.2"
msgid "I should look for a natural crack first."
msgstr "得先找找天然的裂縫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD"
msgid "Magma-nificent!"
msgstr "岩漿，我喜歡！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the magma pile just looking at it."
msgstr "光看著熔岩礦堆，就能想見它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGMAROCK_GOLD.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，顏色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLAMEGEYSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLAMEGEYSER"
msgid "Glorious..."
msgstr "令人愉快..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLAMEGEYSER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLAMEGEYSER.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the krissure."
msgstr "從地熱火泉回去的路得記牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLAMEGEYSER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLAMEGEYSER.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先別走到看不見來路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_RING"
msgid "This goes with something else, I think."
msgstr "這應該要和別的部件裝在一起。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_RING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_RING.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出這裡原本還要接另一件東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_RING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_RING.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先畫下接口的樣子，再去找其餘的部分。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BOX"
msgid "A part for something."
msgstr "是哪件東西上的一個部件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BOX.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出這裡原本還要接另一件東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BOX.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先畫下接口的樣子，再去找其餘的部分。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK"
msgid "For cranking?"
msgstr "用來搖動的？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出這裡原本還要接另一件東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_CRANK.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先畫下接口的樣子，再去找其餘的部分。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_POTATO"
msgid "Wonder what it does?"
msgstr "不知道它有什麼用？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_POTATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_POTATO.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出這裡原本還要接另一件東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_POTATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_POTATO.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先畫下接口的樣子，再去找其餘的部分。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BASE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BASE"
msgid "Seems like it's missing a thing or two."
msgstr "看起來還少了一兩件東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BASE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BASE.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出這裡原本還要接另一件東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BASE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_SW_BASE.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先畫下接口的樣子，再去找其餘的部分。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPE"
msgid "Hey lil buddy, do you like to play with fire too?"
msgstr "嗨，小兄弟，你也喜歡玩火嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPE.1"
msgid "I'd give the prime ape a little room to pass."
msgstr "我給猿猴讓一點路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPE.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想擋住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPEBARREL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPEBARREL"
msgid "What a monkey sty."
msgstr "好一個猴子窩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPEBARREL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPEBARREL.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the prime ape hut in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的猿猴小窩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPEBARREL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIMEAPEBARREL.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the twigs if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些樹枝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBALL"
msgid "I bet the monkeys would have a ball with this thing."
msgstr "我敢打賭猴子喜歡這樣的球。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBALL.1"
msgid "I can just make out the silly monkey ball from here."
msgstr "我在這裡剛好看得見逗猴球。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBALL.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the snakeskin if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多備些蛇皮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_UNLOCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_UNLOCK"
msgid "Fancy monkey."
msgstr "好氣派的猴子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_UNLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_UNLOCK.1"
msgid "Good day to you, Your Majesty. Or is that a little premature?"
msgstr "陛下，您好。還是我稱呼得早了些？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_UNLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_UNLOCK.2"
msgid "What a dignified little monkey."
msgstr "真是隻有派頭的小猴子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_CROWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_CROWN"
msgid "You'd have to have a tiny little head to fit this."
msgstr "腦袋得非常小才能戴得下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_CROWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_CROWN.1"
msgid "Let me try it with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我紮起頭髮試一下它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_CROWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR_CROWN.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜歡眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMFISHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMFISHER"
msgid "Ugh, bet you never get that fish smell out."
msgstr "呃，我敢打賭你永遠也去不掉那股魚腥味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMFISHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMFISHER.1"
msgid "Look, the fishermerm has noticed us."
msgstr "看，魚人漁夫注意到我們了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMFISHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMFISHER.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想擋住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_FISHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_FISHER"
msgid "Fish mongers."
msgstr "魚販子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_FISHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_FISHER.1"
msgid "I'd approach the fishermerm's hut quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近漁人小屋時輕一些，聽聽裡面有沒有動靜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_FISHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_FISHER.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口讓出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSKING"
msgid "He looks kinda dozy."
msgstr "他看起來有點呆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSKING.1"
msgid "I wonder what the yaarctopus looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道這裡剛建成時，章魚王是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSKING.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "從另一邊還能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSCHEST"
msgid "It's filled with sea treats!"
msgstr "裡面裝滿了海洋珍品！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSCHEST.1"
msgid "I ought to check what's already in the octo chest."
msgstr "該檢查一下章魚寶箱裡已經裝了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCTOPUSCHEST.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道備用物資收在哪裡，總歸省心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO"
msgid "A welcome change from red berries."
msgstr "紅漿果變成紅薯，喜聞樂見。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO.1"
msgid "I could make room for the sweet potato at supper."
msgstr "晚餐還能給甘薯留個位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO.2"
msgid "I'd set a serving aside for the late watch."
msgstr "得給守後半夜的人留一份。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED"
msgid "The flames definitely improved it."
msgstr "烤過之後味道更棒了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the cooked sweet potato cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "熟甘薯要放涼些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "為一口熱食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_PLANTED"
msgid "It would be cuter on fire!"
msgstr "它在火上更可愛！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_PLANTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_PLANTED.1"
msgid "I'd remember where that patch grows."
msgstr "我會記住這片植物長在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_PLANTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_PLANTED.2"
msgid "I want to see how it grows in this soil."
msgstr "我想看看它在這片土裡怎麼長。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "Seeds. Sweet."
msgstr "種子。甜甜的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I keep the stellar seeds in a dry pocket."
msgstr "我把圓形種子收在乾燥的口袋裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'll keep a few back for a second sowing."
msgstr "我會留些給下一撥播種。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "Sweet!"
msgstr "太棒了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I'd like to weigh the giant sweet potato before we cut it."
msgstr "我想先稱稱巨型甘薯再切開。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I'll need more than my usual basket."
msgstr "我常用的籃子可裝不下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE"
msgid "Cooked to perfection!"
msgstr "完美的烹飪！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE.1"
msgid "I'd save a serving of the sweet potato souffle for the person who cooked."
msgstr "我想給做飯的人也留一份甘薯蛋奶酥。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATOSOUFFLE.2"
msgid "This is worth getting a clean plate for."
msgstr "值得專門拿個乾淨盤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_WOODLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_WOODLEGS"
msgid "A fine ship."
msgstr "一艘好船。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_WOODLEGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_WOODLEGS.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the \"sea legs\"."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪時「海腿」號表現如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_WOODLEGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_WOODLEGS.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙這邊的時候，誰來留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT"
msgid "I don't think it was made for me."
msgstr "我不認為它是為我做的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT.1"
msgid "Would the lucky hat leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴著幸運帽還能不能戴眼鏡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODLEGSHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜歡眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAIL_WOODLEGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SAIL_WOODLEGS"
msgid "This sail looks like it would be special to someone."
msgstr "這面帆看上去對某個人有著特殊的意義。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_WOODLEGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_WOODLEGS.1"
msgid "I'll check it before we leave the shore."
msgstr "離岸前我要檢查它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_WOODLEGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAIL_WOODLEGS.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "總比到了風浪裡再處理容易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEG_LEG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PEG_LEG"
msgid "I haven't pegged down what this does yet."
msgstr "我還沒有確定這個是幹什麼用的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEG_LEG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEG_LEG.1"
msgid "Someone shaped this to take a person's weight."
msgstr "這是照著能支撐人站立的樣子削出來的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEG_LEG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEG_LEG.2"
msgid "I'd want to smooth every splinter off before using it."
msgstr "使用前我想先把每根木刺都磨平。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PIRATEGHOST"
msgid "What \"arrrr\" you?"
msgstr "你是什麼東西？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEGHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEGHOST.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the pirate ghost."
msgstr "我標一下發現海盜幽靈的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEGHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATEGHOST.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它為什麼偏偏在這個地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILDBORE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILDBORE"
msgid "Not wild about being close to this guy."
msgstr "不怎麼想靠近這傢伙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBORE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBORE.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the wildbore from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安靜的地方觀察野豬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBORE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBORE.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先別動，看看它接下來做什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHEAD"
msgid "Blech!"
msgstr "太令人噁心了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHEAD.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the wildbore head."
msgstr "我標一下發現野豬頭的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHEAD.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把筆記本帶來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHOUSE"
msgid "Add fire and you'd get BBQ!"
msgstr "放把火就能吃烤肉了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHOUSE.1"
msgid "I'd approach the wildbore house quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近野豬舍時輕一些，聽聽裡面有沒有動靜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILDBOREHOUSE.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口讓出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE"
msgid "No need to water this guy."
msgstr "倒是不用給它澆水了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the mangrove grows."
msgstr "我要記住紅樹長在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回來看看有何變化。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE_BURNT"
msgid "Burned right down to the, uh, water."
msgstr "一直燒到了……呃，水面上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE_BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE_BURNT.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of it for my notes."
msgstr "我想把它的樣子畫進筆記。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE_BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANGROVETREE_BURNT.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根邊走，得留意腳下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PORTAL_SHIPWRECKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PORTAL_SHIPWRECKED"
msgid "Time to get outta here."
msgstr "該離開這裡了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTAL_SHIPWRECKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTAL_SHIPWRECKED.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from it."
msgstr "從它回去的路得記牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTAL_SHIPWRECKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTAL_SHIPWRECKED.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先別走到看不見來路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE"
msgid "Here goes!"
msgstr "出發！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE.1"
msgid "I'll mark it on my map."
msgstr "我在圖上標一下它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_ENTRANCE.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我記一下最近的避風處在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_EXIT"
msgid "I'm outta here."
msgstr "我走啦。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_EXIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_EXIT.1"
msgid "I'll mark it on my map."
msgstr "我在圖上標一下它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_EXIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_EXIT.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我記一下最近的避風處在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TIDALPOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TIDALPOOL"
msgid "I wonder which way it would swirl if you flushed it?"
msgstr "我想知道如果把水放掉，它會往哪邊轉？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDALPOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDALPOOL.1"
msgid "I'll mark the tidal pool on my map."
msgstr "我在圖上標一下潮汐池。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDALPOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDALPOOL.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近邊緣先看清腳下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISHINHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISHINHOLE"
msgid "Why here, fishies?"
msgstr "魚兒們，你們為什麼在這裡？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINHOLE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the shoal on my map."
msgstr "我在圖上標一下魚群。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINHOLE.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我記一下最近的避風處在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_TROPICAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISH_TROPICAL"
msgid "Such pretty colors."
msgstr "多麼美麗的顏色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_TROPICAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_TROPICAL.1"
msgid "The colours on the tropical fish are even brighter in the water."
msgstr "熱帶魚身上的顏色在水裡更鮮亮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_TROPICAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_TROPICAL.2"
msgid "I could watch those fins turn in the light all afternoon."
msgstr "魚鰭在光下一轉一轉的，我能看一下午。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TIDAL_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.TIDAL_PLANT"
msgid "It's a plant."
msgstr "是株植物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDAL_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDAL_PLANT.1"
msgid "I want to look at it in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔細看看它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDAL_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TIDAL_PLANT.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回來看看有何變化。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT_TROPICAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT_TROPICAL"
msgid "Plant-y."
msgstr "草木。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT_TROPICAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT_TROPICAL.1"
msgid "I'll leave a marker by these leaves."
msgstr "我想在葉叢邊留個記號。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT_TROPICAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT_TROPICAL.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling at the roots."
msgstr "我湊近看就好，不去拔根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLUP"
msgid "Flup off!"
msgstr "滾開！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLUP.1"
msgid "Look, the flup has noticed us."
msgstr "看，獨眼彈塗魚注意到我們了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLUP.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先別動，看看它接下來做什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FLUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FLUP"
msgid "This blows."
msgstr "這個是吹的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FLUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FLUP.1"
msgid "I'll put a cover over the point before I carry it."
msgstr "帶走前我會先把尖端套住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FLUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FLUP.2"
msgid "The shaft is so light I can barely feel it in my sleeve."
msgstr "細杆真輕，放在袖袋裡幾乎感覺不到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_LAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEA_LAB"
msgid "Can things burn at sea?"
msgstr "海裡的東西能燃燒嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_LAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_LAB.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the sea lab."
msgstr "我標一下發現海上實驗室的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_LAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEA_LAB.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the sand to make this."
msgstr "我記得做它的時候，特地留了沙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUOY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUOY"
msgid "Buoy, I'm glad I have this."
msgstr "燈塔，很高興有它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUOY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUOY.1"
msgid "We'll be able to find our way back by the buoy."
msgstr "回來的時候可以憑浮標認路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUOY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUOY.2"
msgid "I can see where the empty bottle went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪裡用上了空瓶子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERCHEST"
msgid "I keep all my best stuff in there."
msgstr "我最好的東西都收在這裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERCHEST.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in the sea chest."
msgstr "瀧奈一定會把海上箱子裡的東西列張清單。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERCHEST.2"
msgid "I'd like one place where my glasses won't get crushed."
msgstr "我想留個不會壓到眼鏡的地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST"
msgid "Ooo! I hope there are useful items inside."
msgstr "喔！希望裡面裝了有用的東西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the steamer trunk."
msgstr "暫時用不到的可以收進海上旅行箱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUGGAGECHEST.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的東西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERYGRAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERYGRAVE"
msgid "Something's fishy here."
msgstr "這裡有什麼東西很可疑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERYGRAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERYGRAVE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the watery grave in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的海墓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERYGRAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERYGRAVE.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "從另一邊還能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECK"
msgid "Someone has regrets."
msgstr "某人有個遺憾。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECK.1"
msgid "I wonder what the wreck looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道這裡剛建成時，沉船是什麼樣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECK.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也許營地裡有人知道它的來歷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARREL_GUNPOWDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BARREL_GUNPOWDER"
msgid "My favorite type of barrel!"
msgstr "我最喜歡的那種桶！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARREL_GUNPOWDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARREL_GUNPOWDER.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the gunpowder barrel again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我們有閒暇，我想再來看看火藥桶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARREL_GUNPOWDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARREL_GUNPOWDER.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我繞一圈，看得仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RAWLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RAWLING"
msgid "He keeps me company."
msgstr "他一直陪伴著我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAWLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAWLING.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the rawling to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把羅林帶回去給營地裡的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAWLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAWLING.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻過來看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WATER"
msgid "This doesn't need to be watered."
msgstr "這個不需要澆水。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WATER.1"
msgid "A little ripple gave the grass away."
msgstr "一點水紋暴露了草的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_WATER.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光線變化真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.KNIGHTBOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.KNIGHTBOAT"
msgid "Check out your boat, mate."
msgstr "檢查一下你的船，老兄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHTBOAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHTBOAT.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the floaty boaty knight?"
msgstr "浮船騎士平時也是這樣活動的嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHTBOAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHTBOAT.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "與其追過去，不如靜下來觀察。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BAMBOOTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BAMBOOTREE"
msgid "Anymore bamboos? Helloooo?"
msgstr "還有竹子嗎？喂？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BAMBOOTREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BAMBOOTREE.1"
msgid "I'll remember where it grows."
msgstr "我要記住它長在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BAMBOOTREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BAMBOOTREE.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回來看看有何變化。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BUSH_VINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BUSH_VINE"
msgid "Come back!"
msgstr "快長回來吧！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BUSH_VINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BUSH_VINE.1"
msgid "I want to look at it in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔細看看它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BUSH_VINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_BUSH_VINE.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方讓它長開。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS_WATER"
msgid "It's taking a little rest."
msgstr "它暫時休息下了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS_WATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS_WATER.1"
msgid "A little ripple gave it away."
msgstr "一點水紋暴露了它的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS_WATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS_WATER.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光線變化真大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALLYINTRO_DEBRIS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALLYINTRO_DEBRIS"
msgid "Did I do that?"
msgstr "那是我乾的嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLYINTRO_DEBRIS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLYINTRO_DEBRIS.1"
msgid "With the debris here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "這裡有了殘骸，營地的邊界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLYINTRO_DEBRIS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALLYINTRO_DEBRIS.2"
msgid "I'll look along the top to see if it's straight."
msgstr "我順著頂邊看一眼齊不齊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOOK_METEOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOOK_METEOR"
msgid "I'll burn through this book!"
msgstr "我要燒透這本書！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_METEOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_METEOR.1"
msgid "I want to see the first page of “Joy of Volcanology”."
msgstr "我想看看《火山學的樂趣》的第一頁。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_METEOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_METEOR.2"
msgid "I won't read it aloud until I know what it does."
msgstr "知道效果之前，我可不敢念出聲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRATE"
msgid "If I burn it, whatever's inside burns too..."
msgstr "如果我燒了它，裡面的東西也會被燒掉..."

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRATE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the crate."
msgstr "我標一下發現板條箱的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRATE.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我繞一圈，看得仔細些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LAUNCHER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LAUNCHER"
msgid "Only thing better than a spear is the gun that shoots them."
msgstr "唯一比矛更好的東西就是能發射它們的槍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LAUNCHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LAUNCHER.1"
msgid "I'd like to feel the balance of the speargun."
msgstr "我想掂一下矛槍的重心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LAUNCHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LAUNCHER.2"
msgid "My teacher always checked the fittings first."
msgstr "老師總會先檢查裝具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_TROPICAL_SPIDER_WARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_TROPICAL_SPIDER_WARRIOR"
msgid "Give one to Wilson, I'm sure he'd loooove to try it! Heheh."
msgstr "給威爾遜一個吧，我相信他一定很想試試！嘿嘿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_TROPICAL_SPIDER_WARRIOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_TROPICAL_SPIDER_WARRIOR.1"
msgid "I'll leave the tropical switcherdoodle with Webber and his little friends."
msgstr "我把毒液變身塗鴉留給韋伯和他的小夥伴們。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_TROPICAL_SPIDER_WARRIOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_TROPICAL_SPIDER_WARRIOR.2"
msgid "I should label that before anyone mistakes it for a snack."
msgstr "得加個標記，免得有人當成點心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_SURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_SURFBOARD"
msgid "Just a dumb colored board."
msgstr "只是一塊愚蠢的彩木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_SURFBOARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_SURFBOARD.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the surfboard."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪時衝浪板表現如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_SURFBOARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_SURFBOARD.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "總比到了風浪裡再處理容易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "Just a dumb colored board."
msgstr "只是一塊愚蠢的彩色板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFBOARD_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFBOARD_ITEM.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the surfboard, I think."
msgstr "我看這裡放衝浪板夠寬敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFBOARD_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFBOARD_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s!"
msgstr "嗨 %s！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GENERIC.1"
msgid "How are the waves today, %s?"
msgstr "%s，今天的浪怎麼樣？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GENERIC.2"
msgid "%s, shall we take the boards out before supper?"
msgstr "%s，要在晚餐前帶板子去玩會兒嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.ATTACKER"
msgid "Take it easy! I thought you enjoyed chilling, %s!"
msgstr "放輕鬆！我還以為你很享受恐懼呢，%s！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "%s, easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "%s，朋友，先緩緩。我們談談好嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "%s, put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "%s，先把手放下來，我聽你說。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! I'm gonna burn that board!"
msgstr "兇手！我要燒了你那板子！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退後，我看見你做了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受傷了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is pretty chill with a whole bunch of things! Like ghosts!"
msgstr "%s在很多事情上都冷冰冰的！像幽靈一樣！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.REVIVER.1"
msgid "%s, you took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "%s，你救了我們的朋友，我會記得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.REVIVER.2"
msgid "%s, thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "%s，謝謝你在有人需要幫忙時趕了回去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GHOST"
msgid "I better get a heart for %s. And my lighter for her board, Ha! What?"
msgstr "我最好為%s拿到心,再將我的打火機給她的板子。哈！什麼？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GHOST.1"
msgid "%s, stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "%s，跟緊我，我去想辦法找顆心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.GHOST.2"
msgid "%s, we came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "%s，我們一起來的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALANI.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Didn't know you had it in you, %s! Can you show me how to fire dance now?"
msgstr "沒想到你有這個本事，%s！你現在能教我怎麼跳火舞嗎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "%s, please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "%s，請留意火星會落到哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALANI.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "%s, keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "%s，別讓火燒到大家的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILBUR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILBUR.GENERIC"
msgid "Hi %s!"
msgstr "嗨 %s！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A bow for His Majesty, %s."
msgstr "向%s陛下行禮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILBUR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I hope your crossing was calm, %s."
msgstr "%s，希望你來時一路風平浪靜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILBUR.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WILBUR.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s must be really hungry! Who wants to feed em?"
msgstr "%s一定是真餓了！誰願意來喂一下它？"

